<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">YOH YOH</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwatsi Mubuya wa Yesu Kirisitu nga ko Yohana aandikaa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mwatsi Mubuya wa Yesu Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="mt2">nga ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="mt2">aandikaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Bwingiro</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana yaandikaa akitabo kino kwebula mbu yakasomakyo niaimirira ku Yesu ye Kirisitu, Muala wa Ongo, na yakamwimirira ni aba na buyingo mwetsina liwe (20 :31). Yohana uyu abaa muuma mwa bemitsa ikumi na babiri ba Yesu. Yewene ailoleraa mwa mesha mewe abindu byaiandikaa mwa kitabo kino. Aandikaa akitabo kino kweasikya bobaimirire aboshe, na Bayahuti, na bandi bandu bobaimiriraa Yesu. Mwa kitabo kiwe, Yohana abwerekya ku Yesu Kirisitu ye Ongo, na kandi ku Yesu ameba mundu, apfaa kwa musalaba kwebula mbu abakotsi ba ntsambi babe na buingo bwa biro byoshe. Abinwa byoshe byo Yohana aandikaa abibwerekya ku Yesu abaa ateho mundu, wetuwe abaa kandi Ongo. Yesu ashambala mwa kitabo kino kuluenda tushingishiro tulinda na binwa binene birinda byo Yesu aneenaa kwebwerekya kwiye ye Ongo. Yesu nianabula mbu: «Ingye, ngye mukati wa buingo (6:35- 48), ngyenaletaa akyaka mwa kihuo (8:12; 9:5), ingye niri nga lukyo (10:7- 9), ngye musumba mubuya (10:11-14), ngye nipfukya abapfu nani ngye niha abandu bo buingo (11:25), ngye nchira, ngye kuli na kandi ngye buingo (14:6) ngye niri ngakuno amuti wa kuli.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kinwa yairwaa mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Mwa ndangiro, Kinwa abaaho, ne Kinwa abaa kuuma ne Ongo, ne Kinwa abaa Ongo. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Mwa ndangiro, Kinwa abaaho kuuma ne Ongo. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Abindu byoshe byabumbwaa itsukira iye, hatali kiro na kindu kiuma kyokyabumbwaa butsira iye. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mwiye momwabaa abuingo, na buingo ubo bwabaa kyaka kya bandu boshe. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Akyaka ikyo akikoletsa mwa mutsimya, na mutsimya atatsimitsekyo.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Habaa mundu muuma yalikwaa ne Ongo, aretsina liwe ni ye Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Yohana nianawicha nga kaliho, kwepfula amwatsi wa kyaka, kwebula mbu abandu boshe baimirire itsukira iye. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Iye atabaa ye kyaka ikyo, wetuwe kwebula mbu apfule amwatsi wa kyaka ikyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Kinwa abaa kyaka kya kuli, kyokiwicha kwa kihuo, kwekoletsa ku kintsi mundu. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Kinwa abaa mwa kihuo, na kihuo kyabumbwaa mwiye, wetuwe akihuo kitamumenya. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Awichaa mwa kihuo kiwe, wetuwe banyakyabo batamukokera. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Aboshe bobamukokeraa, na bobamuimiriraa, nianahabo maala meba bana ba Ongo. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Abo batabutirwe mu shiama, neri mwishasha ra mubiri, neri mwishasha ra mundu, wetuwe Ongo yabutirebo. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Kinwa nianairwa mundu, nianaikala mwa kati ketu ni auchwire lukoo na kuli. Twaxungaa kwa ngulu yiwe, angulu iyo, Tata yewene yahaayo Muala wa kyusha . <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana apfula amwatsi uwe mbu: «Uyu yonaahulaa mbu: ‹Ira nyuma kwingye aiwicha mundu yanixondoleraa, kubwishi abaaho lubere kwingye.›»<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Tweboshe twameangirira muhango wa kwa lukoo lungi lwabaa nalo, nianatuashanira kutsibu. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ongo ahanaa <char style="w" lemma="aMuomba">aMuomba</char> itsukira ku Musa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 31:18; 34:28.</char></note>, wetuwe alukoo na kuli byawichaa itsukira ku Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char>. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Wetuwe Muala wa kyusha yanaba Ongo, yaliho kuuma ne Tata, iye yamuxwikulaa kwitwe.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amwatsi wa Yohana kuluenda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-18">Mar 1:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Uno wo mwatsi Yohana apfula mwa mango abakulukulu ba Bayahuti be Yerusalemu bamulikaako bakungu, na Balawi kwemubutsa mbu: «Iwe, we inde?» <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana nianaxubyitsabo kyenene mbu: «Ingye nite ngye Kirisitu.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Niyo bamubutsa mbu: «Tsene, Iwe wende? Mbeni iwe we Eliya?» Nianaxubya mbu: «Kiro! Ate ingye iye». Iwe we mutahwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Iwe we mutahwa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aBayahuti ba mwa kianiro ikyo, babaa abalindira mutahwa yobabaa bechi kwa wicha kubwishi lwareilingiliranya lubere lwarewicha ra Kirisitu.</char></note>? Nianaxubya mbu: «Ihi». <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Niabanamubutsa kandi mbu: «Tsene, Iwe wende? Utubwire kwebula mbu nge twaenda tupfulireo boshabatulika. Aubula ute kuluenda wenawene?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana nianaxubya mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">«Niri mulenge yalaka mwa bweru mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">‹Mutunganyanye anchira ya Ninakuwetu›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 40:3.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">nga kwa <char style="w" lemma="amutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwa</char> Isaya abulaa.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Mu bobalikwaa, mwabaa <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">Bafarisayo</char>. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Niabanabutsa Yohana kandi mbu: «Uli ute we <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char>, neri Eliya, neri <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">amutahwa</char>, tsene ni yourubika kubwishi bwaki?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Ingye anibarubika mu mechi, wetuwe mwa kati kenyu muli mundu yomutechi. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Amundu uyo awicha ira nyuma kwingye, nitalirene kiro na hake iminula amiriki ya kwa bilyato biwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">biwe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa mira, mwa Buyahuti, amukotsiho yabaa anaminula amiriki ya bilyato bya ninakuwabo.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Abinwa ibyo byakolwaa i Betaniya, kweshirya wa lwichi lwe Yorotani, ho Yohana abaa anarubikira.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ye Kyana-Buli kya Ongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Bwabere mbu abukya, Yohana nianaxunga Yesu ni awicha harali. Nianabula mbu: «Lola kwa Kyana-Buli kya Ongo kyokitengya <char style="w" lemma="asantsambi">asantsambi</char> sa bandu boshe ba kwa kihuo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 53:6-7.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Uyu yonaahulaa mwa mango naneenaa mbu: ‹Ira nyuma kwingye, aiwicha mundu yanixondoleraa, kubwishi abaaho buxondotsi kwingye.› <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Ingye nabaa nitamwichi. Wetuwe namewicha irubika bandu mu mechi kwebula mbu ni mubwerekye kwa luanda lwa Baisiraeri.»<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yohana nianapfula amwatsi wa kuluenda Yesu mbu: «Shanixunga aMutima wa Ongo ngakuno ikuku rolikima itenga mu mbingu nemuikirako. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Nani nabaa nitamwichi, wetuwe yanilikaa irubika mu mechi, uyo yanibwiraa mbu: ‹Youkendexunga aMutima Akomire ali amukimako nemuikalako, uyo yanarubika mwa Mutima Akomire.› <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Ingye nailoleraa kwa binwa ibi, nani anipfula amwatsi wabyo kuyo ye Muala wa Ongo.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abemitsa babere ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Bwabere mbu abukya, Yohana ni ali aho kandi, kuuma na babiri ba mwa <char style="w" lemma="bemitsa">bemitsa</char> bewe. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Abere axunga Yesu ali atsuka, nianabula mbu: «Sindera aKyana-Buli kya Ongo.» <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Abemitsa babiri babere baumpfa abinwa ibyo, niabanakulikira Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu nianakebera, nianaxunga kwabamukulikira, nianabutsabo mbu: «Amuxondaki?» Niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Rabi, rebula mbu: ‹Mwiyisa› unaba hayi?» <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Muwiche, mukaxungaho.» Niabanaenda, niabanaxunga hanaikala. Niabanashiba naye iyo amubitsi uyo. Sabaa ni asishembashemba saa ikumi sa luoloolo.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andereya, mualabo Simoni Petero, abaa muuma wa mwa bemitsa babiri bobaumpfaa abinwa bya Yohana, baba neimitsa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andereya nianatimana kasa mualabo yalukwa mbu ye Simoni, nianamubwira mbu: «Twamexunga Masiya, rebula mbu: ‹<char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char>.›» <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Inyuma kwaho, Andereya nianatwala Simoni ho Yesu ali. Yesu nianamusindera, nianabula mbu: «Iwe we Simoni muala wa Yohana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yohana </char><char style="ft" closed="false">maandiko maima ma Kikiroki mali na aretsina ra Yona mwa mwanya wa retsina ra Yohana.</char></note>, ukalukwa mbu we Kefa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kefa: aretsina ra kefa, renaliuma ne Petero na mabiri moshe ni bula mbu ibale.</char></note>. rebula mbu: ‹Ibale.›»<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abirangira Firipo ne Tanaere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Bwabere bwakya, Yesu abaa axonda iya i Ngalilaya. Abere mbu atimana Firipo, nianamubwira mbu: «Uniimitse.» <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Firipo abaa mwicha i Betesaita, kwawabo Andereya ne Petero. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Inyuma kwaho, Firipo niatimana Tanaere, nianamubwira mbu: «Twamexunga ku yo Musa aandikaa amyatsi yiwe mwa kitabo kya <char style="w">Muomba.</char> Banabe na <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">batahwa</char> bashambalaa kuluenda iye. Iye ye Yesu we Nasareti, muala wa Yosefu.» <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Tanaere nianabutsa Firipo mbu: «Mbeni kabuya kanganatenga i Nasareti?» Firipo nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Wicha ulole.»<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu abere axunga ko Tanaere awicha harali, nianabula atya kuluenda iye mbu: «Lola ku Muisiraeri wa kuli, mwiye mutali kiro na kitingo. <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Tanaere nianamubutsa mbu: ‹Wanimenyaa ute?› Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: ‹Shanikuxunga buxondotsi Firipo akubirangire ali youli mwesina ra muti wa tini.›» <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Tanaere nianamubwira kandi mbu: «Mwiyisa, iwe we Muala wa Ongo, na kandi iwe we Mwami wa Baisiraeri!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Wameimirira kubwishi namekubwira mbu shanikuxunga ni uli mwesina ra muti wa tini? Ukalola ku binwa bitsibu ilengya ibi.» <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu nianaxuba imubwira mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku mukaxunga ambingu ni ikingukere na <char style="w" lemma="bamalaika">bamalaika</char> ba Ongo ni abauruka nekima ku Muala wa Mundu.»<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Buheruki i Kana ye Ngalilaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Kwabere kwametsuka biro bibiri, mwa mulungu we Kana ya kyango kye Ngalilaya, niamunaba buheruki. Nina wa Yesu naye abaa aliyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Ne Yesu naye abaa ni amelalikwa mwa buheruki umo kuuma na bemitsa bewe. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Mwa mango atifai yahwaa, nina wa Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Batakiwete kandi ku tifai.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Wetuwe Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Mali, kiki kyokiri hakati kawe nani? Akashangi kani katatsakaeraho neki.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Niyo nina abwira abakotsi mbu: «Kintsi kinwa kyakababwira, munakolakyo.» <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Aho habaa bibindi ndatu byobikolirwe mu mabale. Abibindi ibyo, bya Bayahuti babaa banabikamo mechi mobabaa banalekolesa mwa ndungo yabo yareikomya. Mu kintsi kibindi mwabaa mungapfubulirwa mechi amashembashemba litiri iana. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu nianabwira abapfuku abo mbu: «Muuchutse abibindi ibi byo mechi.» Nabo niabanauchutsabyo ihikira kwa susu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Tsene mutehe kwa mechi aya mutwalireo amukulukulu wa linye.» Abapfuku niabanakola batyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Amukulukulu wa linye nianaxoma kwa mechi momabaa mamebinduka tifai. Amukulukulu uyo atamenya ha tifai yametenga. Wetuwe abakotsi bonabene bobatehaa kwa mechi, bobanamenyaa homateherwaa. Tsene ni yabirangira shekuherukya. <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />Abere amewicha, nianamubwira mbu: «Abandu boshe banasheera bobalalikirwe bo tifai mbuya kutsibu kasa, inyuma mwa mango bameotola ipfayo, niyo bashea yoitalokire kushe. Wetuwe iwe ukinawete ku tifai ilokire kutsibu ihikira tsene.»<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yesu akolaa akashingishiro ako mwa mulungu we Kana ye Ngalilaya. Akashingishiro ako kokabaa kabere kwebwerekya angulu iwe, na bemitsa bewe niabanamwimirira.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Inyuma ya abinwa ibyo, Yesu nianaya mwa mulungu we Kaperenaumu kuuma ne nina, na baala babo na bemitsa bewe. Niabanaikala iyo yo biro bike.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahentsa abachurutsi mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Mwa mango alwire lukulu lwa <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char> ya Bayahuti lwabere lwaxonda ieraho, Yesu nianauruka i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Nianatimana bandu mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char> bobautsa nga, na mbuli, na makuku. Na bandi bobabaa abahingya faranga ni baikere kwa mesa mabo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yesu nianahunga muliki kweirao ngonyi yehentsamo abandu boshe mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char> kuuma na sambuli na sanga sabo. Inyuma kwaho, nianakunulanga amesa ma bobabaa abahingya asafaranga, neshesherato hashi. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Nianabwira abautsi ba makuku mbu: «Mutengye abindu byenyu hano. Mutairaa anyumba ya Tata yo nyumba ya buchurutsi!» <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Abemitsa bewe niabanaubuka abinwa ibyo byobiandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire mbu: «Abuxu bwa nyumba yawe, bwendeniulumitsa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 69:10.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Niyo Abakulukulu ba Bayahuti bamubutsa mbu: «Ukatubwerekya kahe kalolero kokangabereretsa ku unalirene ikola utya?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Mushambule <char style="w" lemma="ahekalu">ahekalu</char> iyi, nani nikaxuba ihimbayo mu biro bishatu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Matayo 26:61.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />aBayahuti niabanamubwira mbu: « <char style="w" lemma="Ahekalu">Ahekalu</char> iyi yahimbwaa mu kianiro kya miaka makumi ane na ndatu, nawe ukahimbayo kandi mu biro bishatuho?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abuhimbe bwa hekalu bwatangiraa mwa mwaka wa makumi abiri, lubere Yesu abutwe mwa kianiro kya Herote Mukulu.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Wetuwe <char style="w" lemma="ahekalu">ahekalu</char> yo Yesu abaa aahula yabaa ni amubiri uwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Yesu abere ameotola ipfuka, niyo abemitsa bewe baubuka kwabaa ashambala kuluenda akinwa ikyo. Niabanaimirira aMaandiko Makomire na binwa byaneenaa.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu echi abyoshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Mwa mango Yesu abaa akinali i Yerusalemu mwa lwire lukulu lwa <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char>, bandu bangi niabanamwimirira kubwishi baxungaa kwa tulolero twabaa akola. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Wetuwe Yesu ataimiriraabo kubwishi ni echi aboshe kushe. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Na kandi abaa atalaire ipfulirwa mwatsi wa mundu woshewoshe, kubwishi yenawene abaa echi byobiri mwa myete ya bandu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Nikotemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Mwa Buyahuti mwabaa mukulukulu muuma wa mwa kikanga kya Bafarisayo ni alukwa mbu ye Nikotemu. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Lwire luuma nianaendera Yesu mu kiro nemubwira mbu: «Mwiyisa, twichi ku Ongo amekulika ituiyisa, kubwishi hatali mundu yangakocha ikola atulolero toukola uto, ali atali kuuma ne Ongo.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Mwa kuli, anikubwira mbu: ‹Amundu atangakocha iingira mwa Bwami bwa Ongo atabutirwe ngendo ya kabiri›» <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikotemu nianamubutsa mbu: «Amundu ahara mungumwa angaxuba ibutwa ate? Angafuluka mwa bula bwa nina nebutwa kandi?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Mwa kuli, anikubwira kwa mundu atabutirwe mwa mechi na mwa Mutima, atangakocha iingira mwa Bwami bwa Ongo.» <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />«Kyokyamebutwa mwa mubiri ni kya mubiri, na kyokyamebutwa mwa Mutima AKomire ni kya Mutima Akomire. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Utashishalaa kubwishi namekubwira ku mulirene ibutwa ngendo ya kabiri. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Amuyaa anatsuka nga kwashashire. Ni waumpfa aburunga bwakola, wetuwe ni utechi ira yatenga, neri ira yaya. Kolunali lutyo na mundu yabutwa mwa Mutima.» <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikotemu nianabutsa Yesu mbu: «Abinwa ibi bingakocheka bite?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Iwe uli mwiyisa mukulu mwa kihuo kye Isiraeri, utanechi abinwa ibi? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Mwa kuli anikubwira kwa tuneena binwa byotwichi, nepfula mwatsi wa binwa byotwalolaako, wetuwe imwe mutamuxonda iikiritsa amwatsi wotupfula. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Muli mutangaimirira mwa mango anibabwira binwa byobitsuka kwa kihuo, ni yomukaniimirira mute nikerebabwira binwa byobitsuka mu mbingu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Na kandi hatali mundu yaurukire mu mbingu, ali ate Muala wa Mundu yakimaa mu mbingu. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Nga ko Musa abatulaa anchoka ya mulinga mwa bweru, ne Muala wa Mundu naye analirene ibatulwa, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />kwebula mbu kintsi mundu yamuimirire abe na buingo bwa biro byoshe. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kureba Ongo atsiyiraa kutsibu abandu boshe ba kwa kihuo, ni yalika Muala wa kyusha, kwebula mbu kintsi yamwimirire ataheraa, wetuwe abe na buingo bwa biro byoshe. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Ongo atalikaa Muala kwa kihuo kwebula mbu achire abandu ba kwa kihuo bo lubancha, wetuwe kwebula mbu abandu ba kwa kihuo baufulwe naye. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Yaimirire Muala atichirwe lubancha, wetuwe yatamuimirire ni ameotola ichirwa lubancha, kubwishi ni ataimirire Muala wa Ongo wa kyusha. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Kyokileta alubancha ni kyokino: akyaka kyamewicha mwa kihuo, wetuwe abandu batsiyire amutsimya ilengya akyaka, kubwishi amikolere yabo mibi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kintsi mundu yakola bubi anabaa akyaka, ni aba netinda iwicha hohali akyaka, kwebula mbu amikolere yiwe itangechexungwa kyenene. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Wetuwe yakulikira akuli, anawicha ira kyaka kiri, kwebula mbu amikolere yiwe ixungwe kyenene kweikolwa nga ko Ongo ateekire.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amwatsi mutsindu wa Yohana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanaya mwa kyango kye Yuteya. Nianaikala iyo kishangi kike kuuma nabo ni <char style="w" lemma="arubika">arubika</char>. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohana naye abaa <char style="w" lemma="arubika">arubika</char> i Ainoni, hofi ne Salimu, kubwishi iyo yabaa mechi mangi. Abandu beremuhikira, naye ni <char style="w" lemma="ererubikabo">ererubikabo</char>. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Mo kianiro umo, Yohana abaa ni atatsahirwa mwa nyumba ya muliki.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Lwire luuma, niakunapfumbuka buhaka hakati ka bemitsa ba Yohana na Muyahuti muuma kuluenda andungo yabo yareihotsa. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Niabanaendera Yohana kwemubutsa mbu: «Mwiyisa, uubukire amundu uyo yabaa kuuma nawe kweshirya ya Yorotani, yowapfulaa amwatsi uwe? Talola ku yoyu tsene ahara arubika, na bandu boshe abaya yali.» <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana nianaxubya mbu: «Hatali kiro na mundu muuma yangakocha iba na kindu kyoshekyoshe ali ataherwekyo ne Ongo. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Imwe mwenabene mobapfutsi ba mwatsi wani ku nabulaa kwingye nitali ngye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char>, wetuwe nilikirwe kwemuxondolera.» <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Yali na muheruki ye shekuherukya, wetuwe mwira wa yaherukya anaimana hofi naye nemuhulikya, anamoa kutsibu aumpfa amulenge wa yaherukya. Nani konimoa nityo, na lumoo lwani lwamebererera tsene. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Angulu iwe ilirene iba nyingi ku yani. <verse eid="JHN 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Yatenga ira luulu, ali ira luulu wa byoshe. Na wa kwa kihuo, ni wa kihuo, na binwa byaneena nabyo bya kwa kihuo. Yawichaa itenga i mu mbingu, ali haluluulu wa byoshe. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Iye apfula mwatsi wa byalolaako nehulikya, wetuwe hatali kiro na mundu yaikiritsa amwatsi wapfula ku wa kuli. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Kintsi yaikiritsa amwatsi wapfula ku wa kuli, abereretsa ku Ongo ye kuli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Yalikwaa ne Ongo ananeena abinwa bya Ongo, kubwishi Ongo anamwuchutsa Amutima uwe butsira luero. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Ongo atsiyire Muala, amehira abindu byoshe mwa minwe siwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Kintsi mundu yaimirire Muala ni ali na buingo bwa biro byoshe, na yatinda iimirira Muala ni atendexunga kwa buingo, wetuwe abutsibuke bwa Ongo ni bwendemuikalako.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu asimola na mukatsi Musamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Yesu nianakengula kwa Bafarisayo bahara na mwatsi kwiye arubika bemitsa bangi ilengya Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Mwa kuli, Yesu yewene atatangire arubika mundu, wetuwe abemitsa bewe bobabaa banarubika. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yesu nianatenga i Yuteya nianafuluka i Ngalilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Kwehika iyo, ni lilirene itsuka mwa kyango kye Samariya <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Nianahika hofi na mutsi muuma we Samariya walukwa mbu Sikari, wabaa hofi na rexwa ro Yakobo ahaa muala Yosefu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ndangiro 33:19; Yoshua 24:32.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Aho hohabaa aretehero ra Yakobo. Kubwishi Yesu abaa ni ametama mwa luendo, nianaikala kwa musike waro mu saa asishembashemba saa ndatu sa kati ka mwishi. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Niyo mukatsi muuma Musamariya awicha iteha mechi. Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Nihe mechi mexoma.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Mo mango umo abemitsa bewe ni bameya iula bilyo kwa mutsi. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Niyo amukatsi Musamariya uyo abwira Yesu mbu: «Iwe uli Muyahuti, nani niri mukatsi Musamariya, ungakocha ute inihema mechi mexoma?» aBayahuti babaa bataumpfiritsanya na Basamariya. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu nianamuxuxubyitsa mbu: «Uli ungamenyire kyo Ongo anahana, nende yakubwira mbu: ‹Nihe mechi mexoma, iwe nge ungamuhemire mechi, naye nge angakuhere mechi momaleta buingo.›» <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Amukatsi uyo nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, utawete ku kipfuma kyetehamo mechi, nao mali mu kiribu kire kutsibu. Wametengya amechi ma buingo hai? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Tatakulitsa wetu Yakobo yatuhaa axoko iyi, anabe iye kuuma na baala, na bipfuanwa biwe byaxomaa kwa mechi aya. Mbeni auanikira ku uli mukulukulu ilengya Yakobo?» <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Kintsi mundu yaxoma kwa mechi aya ni akapfa nyota kandi. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Wetuwe amundu yakendexoma kwa mechi monikendemuha ingye, atikiendepfa nyota kiro na hake. Amechi monikendemuha, mendeba mwiye nga xoko yoixoxobokamo mechi ma buingo bwa biro byoshe.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Amukatsi uyo nianamubwira mbu: «Ninakuwetu, unihe kwa mechi ayo, kwebula mbu nitakipfaa nyota kandi, neri nitakixubaa iwicha iteha mechi hano.» <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Enda, yobirangire mulume wawe, ube nemuleta hano.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Amukatsi nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Nitawete ku mulume.» Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Auneena kuli ku utawete ku mulume, <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />kubwishi wameotola ihikyibwa na balume batano, na mulume youli naye tsene atali wawe. Kwikyo auneena kuli.» <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Niyo amukatsi uyo amuxubyitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, anixunga kwiwe uli <char style="w" lemma="mutahwa">mutahwa</char>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Abotatakulitsa baimanikiraa Ongo kwa kitwa uku, wetuwe imwe mo Bayahuti munerebula ku i Yerusalemu hohalirene iimanikira Ongo. <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Niimirire, akianiro akiwicha, kyomutendeimanikiramo Tata kwa kitwa uku, neri i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Imwe, mwe Basamariya munaimanikira kyomutechi, itwe tunaimanikira kyotwichi, kubwishi abuufulo abutenga kwa Bayahuti. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Wetuwe akuwicha kianiro, nakyo kyahara kiriho, bobanaimanikira Ongo mwa kuli bendeimanikira Tata mu mutima na mu kuli, kubwishi Tata axonda bandu bobamuimanikira batyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Ongo Mutima, na bobamuimanikira balirene ni bamuimanikira mu mutima na mu kuli.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Amukatsi nianamubwira mbu: «Nichi ku <char style="w" lemma="Masiya">Masiya</char> yalukwa mbu ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char> endewicha. Na mwa mango endewicha endetuiyisa abinwa byoshe.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Ingye, ngye nineena nawe, ngye iye.» <verse eid="JHN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Mo kashangi umoho, abemitsa ba Yesu niabanafuluka, niabanashishala kwemuxunga ali asimola na mukatsi. Wetuwe hataba kiro na muuma mubo yabutsa mbu: «Auxondaki?» Neri mbu: «Ausimola naye kubwishi bwaki?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Niyo amukatsi uyo asiya akibindi kiwe kya mechi aho nefuluka kwa mutsi kwebwira abandu mbu: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Muwiche mulole kwa mundu yamenibwira abinwa byani byoshe byonakolaa. Mbeni amundu uyu, atangaba ni ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char>?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Abandu niabanatenga mwa mutsi baendera Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Mo kashangi umo, abemitsa ba Yesu niabanaitondoola kuye mbu: «Mwiyisa, tanga walya bilyo.» <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Wetuwe nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Niwete ku bilyo byomutechi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Abemitsa bewe niabanatangira ibutsabutsanya mbu: «Mbeni hali mundu yamemuletera bilyo?» <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Abilyo byani ni ikola areshasha ra yanilikaa neotola amulimo wanihaa. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mbeni imwe mute bahanga bebula mbu: ‹Hashiba myetsi ine ni abaxola?› Wetuwe ingye anibabwira mbu musindere kushe amaxwa, amyaka yameera, nayo ailindira ixolwa! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Amuxotsi ameotola ihabwa aluhembo luwe, ni atuma amyaka kubwishi bwa buingo bwa biro byoshe, kwebula mbu yaxoleka, na yaxola bamoe kuuma. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kureba akinwa kya muani uyu kiri kuli mbu: ‹Mundu muuma anaxoleka, na undi ni axola.› <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Ingye nabalikaa mbu muxole kyomutanubiraa, bauma banubaa, nemwe mwameingira mu kya bandi banubiraa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Basamariya bangi ba kwa mutsi uyo niabanaimirira Yesu kubwishi bwa binwa bya mukatsi uyo apfulaa mbu: «Amenibwira abyoshe byonakolaa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />aBasamariya babere bahikira Yesu, niabanaitondoola kuye mbu aikale kuuma nabo, naye nianaikala iyo biro bibiri. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Na bandi bandu bangi baimirira kubwishi bwa binwa biwe, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />nabo niabanabwira amukatsi uyo mbu: «Tsene twameimirira, kute kubwishi bwa binwa byowatubwiraaho, wetuwe kubwishi twenabene twameiumpfira, na kandi twichi ku ye Muufutsi wa kihuo.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mwana wa mukulukulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Kwabere kwametsuka biro bibiri, Yesu nianatenga iyo, nianaenda i Ngalilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yesu abaa ni amepfulao ku <char style="w" lemma="amutahwa">amutahwa</char> atapfibwa xoni mwa kihuo kiwe yewene. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Wetuwe abere ahika i Ngalilaya, abandu ba kyango ikyo niabanamukokera kushe, kubwishi ibo nabo ni babaa bali i Yerusalemu mwa lwire lukulu lwa Pasaka, baba nexunga kwa binwa byoshe byakolaa iyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Niyo Yesu axuba i Kana, mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya, hahingitsaa amechi kweba <char style="w" lemma="tifai">tifai</char>. Iyo habaa hali mukulukulu muuma mukotsi wa mwami, yabaa alwetse muala mwa mulungu we Kaperenaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Abere aumpfao ku Yesu amehika i Ngalilaya ni atenga i Yuteya, amukulukulu uyo, nianamuendera, nemuhema mbu aende i Kaperenaumu ilamya muala yabaa ali ku lwepfa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Imwe mutaxungire ku tulolero na ku bishishatsa, ni mutiimirire kiro na hake.» <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Amukulukulu uyo nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu anikuhema uwiche mwa mwani buxondotsi amwana wani ni atatsapfa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Xuba ira mwawe, muala wawe aliho.» Amukulukulu uyo nianaimirira akinwa kyo Yesu amebula, nianaenda. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Abere ali yafuluka, bapfuku bewe bauma niabanawicha ikorana naye nemubwira kwa mwana uwe mukambwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Nianabutsabo nga mwana shatangira iiumpfa kushe mu kashangiki. Nabo niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ashishira yamulikaa mweolo, mu saa asishembashemba saa sirinda sa mwishi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ishe wa mwana uyo nianakengula ku mwa saa iyeyoho mo Yesu amubwiraa ku muala mukambwe. Iye na kipfunga kiwe kyoshe niabanaimirira Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ako ko kalolero ka kabiri ko Yesu akolaa i Ngalilaya ni atenga i Yuteya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mundu wa makonongola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Inyuma wa binwa ibyo, Yesu nianaya mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu, mu lwire lukulu lwa Bayahuti. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Na mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu, hofi na lukyo lwa sambuli, habaa hali kishima ni kiri na nyukyo itano. Akishima ikyo, ni kinalukwa mwa Kieburaniya mbu: «Betesaita.» <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Mwa nyukyo umo, mwabaa muonchire bakoni bangi. Mubo, mwabaa bihumahumi, na birema, na bobalwere makonongola. Babaa banerelindira amechi mbu maruburwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Malaika wa Ninakuwetu abaa muhanga wekima mwa kishima ikyo nerubura amechi. Amukoni mubere yakaingira mwa mechi, ni alama bukoni bwoshebwoshe bwalwere. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Aho habaa mundu muuma ni amebanda myaka makumi ashatu na munane ni mukoni. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu abere amulolako, nekengula kwameba mukoni wa biro bingi, nianamubutsa mbu: «Auxonda ilamibwa?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Amukoni nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, nitawete ku mundu yanganirubika mwa kishima mwa mango amechi amaruburwa. Na mwa mango anixonda iirubika mwa mechi, undi mundu nianixondolera kweirubikamo.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Batuka, tsimba mundara wawe ube neenda. <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Mo kashangi umoho, amundu uyo nianalama aba netsimba amundara uwe neiendera.» Alwire ulo lwabaa lwire lwa <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">Sabato</char>. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Ikyo kituma aBayahuti babwira amundu yalamibwaa uyo mbu: «Munolwire <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">Sabato</char>, utali na rubu lweheka angyingo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Yeremiya 17:21; Nehemiya 13:19.</char></note> yawe.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Amundu uyo nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Amundu yashanilamya, yashanibwira mbu: ‹Heka angyingo yawe ube neenda.›» <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Niyo bamubutsa mbu: «Inde uyo yamekubwira mbu: ‹Heka angyingo yawe ube neenda?›» <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Wetuwe amundu yalamibwaa uyo abaa ni atakimwichi, kubwishi Yesu abaa ni ameshencheberera mwa mubuanano munene wa bandu bobabaa bali aho. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianakorana naye mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char>, nianamubwira mbu: «Utatsene ku wamelama? Tsene, utakyiendekola ntsambi, utangendechehikirwa na kinwa kibi kutsibu.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Amundu uyo nianaya ipfulirao aBayahuti ku Yesu yamemulamya. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ikyo kituma aBayahuti batangira ixonda binwa byesongera Yesu, kubwishi akolaa akinwa ikyo mu lwire lwa <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">Sabato</char>. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Wetuwe Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Tata anakola mu kintsi kashangi, nani banatyoho.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Akinwa ikyo, kituma abakulukulu ba Bayahuti baxonda nchira yemwita. Kute kubwishi bwa arecha mwa <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">Sabato ho</char>, wetuwe kubwishi abulaa kandi mbu Ongo ye Ishe, kweilinganya ne Ongo.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">aMaala ma Muala wa Ongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu nianabwirabo kandi mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku Muala wa Ongo atangakocha ikola kinwa kyoshekyoshe mwishasha liwe yewene. Anerekunekolaho kyaxunga ku kyo Ishe anakola. Kubwishi abyoshe byo Tata anakola, Muala naye ni akolabyo. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Kubwishi Tata atsiyire Muala, ni yeremubwerekya byakola yewene. Akenderemubwerekya binwa bingi kutsibu kandi ilengya ibyo, kwebula mbu mukoche ishishala. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Kubwishi nga ko Tata anapfukya bandu nehabo buingo, ne Muala, kwonokoho, anaha buingo yo kintsi yashashire. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Na kandi, Tata atachira kiro na mundu muuma yo lubancha, wetuwe ameha Muala amaala moshe marecha lubancha, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />kwebula mbu abandu boshe bapfe Muala yo xoni nga kobanerepfa Tata yo xoni. Ula yatapfire Muala yo xoni, ni atapfire Tata yamulikaa yo xoni. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Mwa kuli anibabwira ku ula yahulikya akinwa kyani neimirira yanilikaa, ali na buingo bwa biro byoshe. Iye atendechirwa lubancha, wetuwe ni amekenga alupfu neba na buingo.» <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />«Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku kwendewicha kianiro, nakyo kyahara kiriho, mwa bapfu bendeba bahulikya amulenge wa Muala wa Ongo, na bobakendehulikyao, bakendebaho. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Ngakuno ko Tata ali na maala ma rehana abuingo bwa biro byoshe, kwanameha ne Muala amaala marehana abuingo bwa biro byoshe. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Ameha ne Muala maala mecha lubancha, kubwishi iye, ye Muala wa Mundu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mutashishalaa kubwishi bwa binwa ibyo. Kwendehika kianiro, abapfu boshe bobali mwa masinda, bakendeba bahulikya amulenge uwe, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />netenga mwa masinda mabo. Bobakolaa bibuya bendepfuka neya mwa buingo, wetuwe bobakolaa abibi bendepfuka nechirwa lubancha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ndanieri 12:2.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atuliho twa mwatsi wa maala ma Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Nitangakocha ikola kinwa ngyenawene. Ninacha lubancha nga ko Ongo anibwira na lubancha lonamecha ni lwaba lwa butunganane, kubwishi nitanixonda ikola areshasha rani, wetuwe areshasha ra yanilikaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Ni ningaba nikerepfula amyatsi yani ngyenawene, amyatsi yani iyo ni itangaikiritsibwa ku ya kuli. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Wetuwe hali undi mundu yanerepfula amyatsi yani, nani nichi ku amyatsi yapfula kwingye, ni ya kuli. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Imwe mwalikaa ndumwa ira mwa Yohana, naye apfulaa mwatsi wali kuli. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Mwa kuli ingye, nitanixonda kaliho ka mundu, wetuwe anineena abinwa ibi kwebula mbu muufulwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana abaa ngakuno itala roliwaka nekoletsa, nemwe, mu kianiro kike mwanashashaaho imoera akyaka kiwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Wetuwe ingye niri na mwatsi munene kutsibu alengyitse wapfulwaa ne Yohana. Kubwishi amulimo wonikola wo Tata anilikaa ibereretsa, na mulimo wonikola apfula amwatsi wani ku Tata yanilikaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Ne Tata yanilikaa ameba kaliho ka mwatsi wani. Imwe mutatsamwahulikya amulenge uwe mu kianiro kyoshekyoshe, mutanatsamwaxunga abusu buwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Akinwa kiwe kitali mwimwe, kubwishi mutaimirire yalikwaa naye. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Muiye kushe aMaandiko Makomire, kubwishi munereanikira ku mungabonekya muo abuingo bwa biro byoshe. aMaandiko ayo momapfula amwatsi wani. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Naho imwe mutamuxonda iwicha yoniri mbu mube na buingo. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Ingye nitanihabwa ngulu yoitenga ku bandu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Wetuwe ingye nibechi imwe mutatsiyire Ongo. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ingye namewicha mwetsina ra Tata, nemwe mutamuxonda inikokera. Wetuwe hali undi yawicha mwetsina liwe yewene, imwe ni mukamukokera. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ni mungaimirire mute, imwe, momuisingya mwenabene ku mwenabene, mutamuba nexonda ngulu yoitenga ku Ongo yenawene? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Mutaani kiraa kwingye nikabasongera ku Tata. Musa yomwainihiraa yakendebasongera. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Muli mwaimiriraa Musa, nge mwaniimirire nani, kubwishi iye yaandikaa amwatsi wa kuluenda ingye. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Wetuwe muli mutaimirire byo Musa aandikaa, niyo mukaimirira mute abinwa byonineena?<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aha balume bihumbi bitano bo bilyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Inyuma wa binwa ibyo, Yesu nianaya kwa lindi ishirya ra angetsi, ye Ngalilaya, yoilukwa kandi mbu Tiberiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tiberiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alindi tsina iri ra ngetsi ye Ngalilaya alibwerekya amulungu we Tiberiya yali kwa munda wa malenga itsuba wa ngetsi.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Mubuanano munene wa bandu niaunamukulikira, kubwishi abandu abo baxungaa kwa tulolero twabwerekyaa kwalamya abakoni. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu nianauruka kwa kitwa, neikala iyo kuuma na bemitsa bewe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" /><char style="w" lemma="aPasaka">aPasaka</char>, lwire lukulu lwa Bayahuti, lwabaa lwahara hofi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu abere alalamira, nianaxunga mubuanano munene wa bandu ni amuhikira. Ni yabutsa Firipo mbu: «Hayi hotungakocha iula bilyo kwehabyo abandu aba?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Aneenaatyo kweereka Firipo, kubwishi iye abaa echi kyakakola. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Firipo nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Nakiro twaula mikati ya tinari maana mabiri, kintsi mundu ni atitole kiro na kiche kya mukati.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Undi mwimitsa uwe yalukwa mbu ye Andereya, muala wabo Simoni Petero, nianamubwira mbu: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Hano hali mwana muuma yawete ku mikati itano ya shayiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shayiri </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shano ishushire nga bulo.</char></note> kuuma na fi ibiri. Wetuwe abilyo ibi bitangauutya bandu bangaha.»<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu niananeena mbu: «Mubwire abandu mbu baikale hashi.» Aho habaa hali biti bingi. Niabanaikala hashi, na muancho wa balume abaa ashembashemba bihumbi bitano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianatsimba amikati iyo, nianasima Ongo, neabirayo kwa bandu bobabaa baiekere aho. Nianahabo na fi nga kobashashire. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Babere bameuuta, Yesu nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Mutololere abisialitsa, kwebula mbu hataheraa kindu.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ni yobatololerabyo neuchutsa bitonga ikumi na bibiri bya bisialitsa bya mikati itano iyo ya shayiri yobalyaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Abandu babere baxunga kwa kalolero ako ko Yesu abwerekyaa, niabaneena mbu: «Mwa kuli, amundu uyo <char style="w" lemma="mutahwa">mutahwa</char> yabaa alirene iwicha mwa kihuo!» <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Mwa mango Yesu akengulaa kwabaxonda ihika imutsimba mu maala, nemuira mbu abe mwami, nianaya kandi kwa kitwa yenawene.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atandaira kwa mechi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22">Mat 14:22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Lwabere lwahara luoloolo, abemitsa bewe niabanakima neya kwa ngetsi. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Niabanauruka mwa mashuwa neshabuka angetsi kweya i Kaperenaumu. Amutsimya abaa ni ameotola itowa, ne Yesu abaa ni atatsashinganabo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Kwa ngetsi niakunatsuka muhusi mutsibu, na mulaba. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Abemitsa babere bamekola buende bwa bilometere bitano neri ndatu, baxunga ku Yesu ni ahara ali hofi na mashuwa, ni atandaira kwa nyancha. Kubwishi bwekyo, niabanaubaha. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Wetuwe Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Ingye uno, mutaubahaa!» <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ibobabaa abaxonda imuurukya mwa mashuwa, wetuwe mo kashangi umoho amashuwa mahika kwa kyambu kya hobabaa abaya.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abandu baxonda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Bwabere bwakya, abandu bobashibaa kweshirya ya ngetsi bakengula ku habaa hanaliho mashuwa mauma. Bakengulaa kandi ku Yesu ataingire mwa mashuwa kuuma na bemitsa bewe, wetuwe shabaenda bonabene. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Ninakuwetu abere amesima Ongo, mandi mashuwa momatengaa mwa mulungu we Tiberiya mahika hofi na hobaliraa amikati. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Abandu babere bakengula ku Yesu, banabe na bemitsa bewe batali aho, niabanauruka mwa bwato kweya i Kaperenaumu kwexonda Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ye mukati wa buingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Abandu abo niabanashingana Yesu kwa lindi ishirya ra ngetsi, baba nemubutsa mbu: «Mwiyisa shauhika hano mangoki?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku mutamunixonda kubwishi bwa tulolero tonabwerekyaa, wetuwe amunixonda kubwishi mwalyaa neuuta mikati. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Muterekolera abilyo byobinabiha. Wetuwe munerekolera abilyo byobingaleama neleta buingo bwa biro byoshe. Abilyo ibyo, byo Muala wa Mundu endebaha. Kubwishi iye ye Ongo, Tata amemuhirako akalolero ka bukulukulu buwe.» <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Niabanamubutsa mbu: «Tuire tute kwebula mbu tukoche ikola amulimo wa Ongo?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Amulimo we Ongo axonda mbu mukole, ni ibula mbu muniimirire ingye, ngye nalikwaa naye.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Niabanamubutsa mbu: «Ukatubwerekya kaloleroki kwebula mbu tukuimirire? Ukakolaki?» <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Abotatakulitsa balyaa mana mwa bweru, nga kokiandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire momabwire mbu: «Nianahabo bilyo bya mukati watenga mu mbingu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 16:4,15; Saburi 78:24.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira, Musa atabahaa mukati wa mu mbingu, wetuwe Tata yabaha amukati wa kuli wa mu mbingu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kubwishi amukati we Ongo ahana, ni wakima mu mbingu neleta buingo kwa kihuo.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Niyo bamubwira mbu: «Ninakuwetu, uneretuha amukati uyo abiro byoshe.» <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Ingye, ngye mukati wa buingo. Ula yakawicha yoniri, atikiendepfa nchala kiro na hake. Na yaniimirire, atikyiendepfa nyota kiro na hake. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Wetuwe Yesu nianabwirabo mbu nakiro mwanilolako, wetuwe mutaimirire. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Aboshe bo Tata aniha banawicha yoniri, nani nitendetinda kiro na hake ula yawicha yoniri. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kubwishi namekima mu mbingu kwebula mbu nikole areshasha ra yanilikaa, wetuwe litali areshasha rani. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Na reshasha ra yanilikaa ni ibula mbu nitahetsaa kiro na muuma mu banihaa, wetuwe nipfukyebo mwa lwire lwa ntsindiro. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Mwa kuli, areshasha ra Tata ni ibula mbu, aboshe bobaxunga ku Muala, nemwimirira ni baba na buingo bwa biro byoshe, nani nikendepfukyabo mwa lwire lwa ntsindiro.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />aBayahuti batangira iyongwa, kubwishi Yesu ni amebula kwiye ye mukati wa buingo wakimaa itenga mu mbingu. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Nabo niabanabula mbu: «Mbeni uyu atali ye Yesu muala wa Yosefu? Mbeni tutechi ishe ne nina? Angakocha ate ibula mbu akimaa itenga mu mbingu?» <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Mutabaa na buyongwa mwa kati kenyu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Hatali mundu yangawicha yoniri ali ate Tata yamemulika kwingye, nani nikendemupfukya mwa lwire lwa ntsindiro. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Mwa bitabo bya <char style="w" lemma="batahwa">batahwa</char> muandikirwe mbu: ‹Aboshe bakendeiyisibwa ne Ongo.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 54:13.</char></note> Kintsi mundu yaumpfira Tata nekulikira ameyiso mewe, anawicha yoniri. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Nitabwire ku hali mundu woshewoshe yaxungire ku Tata ali ate yatengaa ira mwa Ongo, uyo yaxungaa ku Tata. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku yaimirire ni ali na buingo bwa biro byoshe. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Ingye, ngye mukati wa buingo. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Aboxokulitsa balyaa kwa mana mwa bweru, bapfa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Wetuwe hano hali mukati wakima itenga mu mbingu, yalya kuo atendepfa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Ingye, niri mukati wa buingo wakimaa itenga mu mbingu. Amundu ni angaba akelya kwa mukati uko, ni akabaho abiro byoshe. Amukati wonikendehana, wo mubiri wani, anihanao kwebula mbu akihuo kibe na buingo.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Niyo aBayahuti batangira ikuba buhaka butsibu bonabene ku bonabene mbu: «Amundu uyu angakocha ate ituha amubiri uwe mbu tulyeo?»<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira, mutalire kwa mubiri wa Muala wa Mundu na mutaxomire kwa shiama yiwe, ni mutendeba na buingo mwimwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Kintsi yalya kwa mubiri wani nexoma kwa shiama yani ni ali na buingo bwa biro byoshe. Nani nikendemupfukya mwa lwire lwa ntsindiro. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Amubiri wani bilyo bya kuli na shiama yani kixomyo kya kuli. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Yalya kwa mubiri wani nexoma kwa shiama yani ni ali mwingye, nani ni niri mwiye. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Nga ko Tata yaliho anilikaa, nani niriho mwa maala mewe. Na kintsi mundu yanilya, akabaho mwingye. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Uyu wo mukati wakimaa itenga mu mbingu. Amukati uyu atali ngakuno wa botatakulitsa benyu balyaa mwa bweru, nepfa. Wetuwe yakalya kwa mukati uyu endebaho abiro byoshe.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu aneenaa abinwa ibi mwa mango abaa aiyisa mwa <char style="w" lemma="sinakoki">sinakoki</char> i Kaperenaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abinwa bya buingo bwa biro byoshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Mwa mango abemitsa ba Yesu baumpfaa abinwa ibyo, bangi mubo niabananeena mbu: «Abinwa byo Yesu aiyisa ibi bitsibu. Inde yangaikiritsabyo?» <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu nianamenya kwa bemitsa bewe bameyongwa kubwishi bwa kinwa ikyo, nianabutsabo mbu: «Akinwa iki kyamebababatsa? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Mungaanikira mute mukexunga Muala wa Mundu axuba iuruka habaa ali lubere? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />aMutima wa Ongo yahana abuingo, amundu yewene atangakocha. Abinwa byonaneenaa nemwe, binwa bya Mutima, nabyo abileta buingo bwa biro byoshe. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Wetuwe bauma mwimwe bataniimirire.» Yesu abulaa atyo, kubwishi amenyaa lubere bobatamuimirire na yakendemuhota. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Yesu nianaxuba ineena mbu: «Kubwishi bwekyo, nababwiraa ku hatali mundu yangahika yoniri, ali liteshasha ra Tata.» <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kubwishi bwa binwa ibyo, bangi mwa bemitsa bewe niabanamusiya, bataxuba iimitsanya naye. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Niyo Yesu abutsa abemitsa ikumi na babiri mbu: «Nemwe amuxonda ienda?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petero nianaxubya mbu: «Ninakuwetu, tukaya ira mwande? Iwe auneena binwa bya buingo bwa biro byoshe. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Netwe, tuimirire, twichi kwiwe uli mundu Akomire wa Ongo.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Ngyewene ngyenabalondolaa mwe ikumi na babiri, wetuwe muuma mwimwe Shitani.» <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Aneenaa atyo kuluenda Yuta muala wa Simoni Isikariyote, yakendemuhota, naye ni muuma mwa bemitsa bewe ikumi na babiri.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Baala babo Yesu batinda imwimirira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Inyuma ya binwa ibyo, Yesu nianatsuka mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya. Atatsiyiraa itsuka mwa kyango kye Yuteya, kubwishi abakulukulu ba Bayahuti babaa abaxonda imwita. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Mo kianiro umo, lwire lukulu luuma lwa Bayahuti lolulukwa mbu Mitanda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mitanda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lwabaa lwire lukulu lwa mwa Buyahuti lobabaa banakolamo linye ra rexola aMisabibu na Miseituni. Na kandi mo biro umo, mo babaa banahema mbu kwa mwaka wa wicha kuwe mpfula. Mwa mango abalya alinye ra lwire lukulu ulo, babaa banaba mu mitanda yoihimbirwe mu bisani bya miti. Babaa banaira batyo kweubuka kwa boshekulitsa babandaa mwa bweru mo myaka makumi ane.Soma Balawi 23:33.</char></note> ni luli hofi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Banyakyabo Yesu niabanamubwira mbu: «Tenga hano, enda i Yuteya nge abemitsa bawe balola kwa bishishatsa byoukola. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Ali auxonda mbu umenyibwe, ni utikole kindu mu bubixo. Kubwishi uli aukola binwa biri ngebyo, ni waibwerekya mwa mbere sa bandu boshe.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Banabe na baala babo, nabo batamwimirira. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Akashangi katatsakaeraho kwingye, wetuwe kwimwe atushangi toshe tukwirire. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Abandu ba kwa kihuo, batangababaa. Wetuwe ingye, abanibaa kubwishi anipfula amwtsi mbu amikolere yabo mibi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Imwe muye mwa linye. Ingye nitatsanaenda neki mwa linye iri, kubwishi akashangi kani katatsakaeraho.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Abere amebwirabo abinwa ibyo, nianashiba i Ngalilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aya mwa linye ra mitanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Mwa mango baala babo Yesu bayaa mwa linye, Yesu naye nianayayo. Wetuwe ayaayo mu bubixo butsira iibwerekya kyenene. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Abakulukulu ba Bayahuti babaa abamuxonda mwa linye nebutsa mbu: «Mbeni amundu uyo ali hai?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Mwa kati ka bandu abo mwabaa muli miririkano mingi kuluenda iye. Bauma mbu: «Iye mundu mubuya.» Na bandi mbu: «Ihi, ate batyo, atinga abandu.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Wetuwe hatali mundu woshewoshe yaneenaa naye kyenene, kubwishi aboshe ni baubahire abakulukulu ba Bayahuti. <verse eid="JHN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Alinye rabere rahara liri mwa katikati, Yesu nianaingira mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char> netangira iyisa abandu. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />aBayahuti niabanashishala, neneena mbu: «Amundu uyu, amebonekya ate abwenge buli ngobu, naye atasomire?» <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Ameyiso moniiyisa mate mani, wetuwe ma Ongo yanilikaa. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Amundu yangashasha ikola areshasha ra Ongo, ni akamenya kwa meyiso mani amatenga ira mwa Ongo, neri aniiyisao mwetsina rani. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Amundu yaneena mwa maala mewe yewene, ni axonda angulu yiwe yewene. Wetuwe yaxonda angulu ya mundu yamulikaa, uyo nianeena akuli, na mwiye ni mutali kiro na bubi. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Mbeni Musa atabahaa Muomba? Wetuwe hate kiro na muuma mwimwe yatsimbire kuo. Amuxonda inita kubwishi bwaki?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Amubuanano wa bandu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Ulimo kixwatsi! Inde yaxonda ikwita?» <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Nakolaa kashingishiro kauma mwa lwire lwa <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">Sabato</char>, na mweboshe mushishala.» <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa yabateekaa imwe mbu muneremonia abana benyu ba butsana. Mwa kuli aboxokulitsa bobatangiraa andungo iyo, Musa ni atatsabutwa. Imwe muli na ndungo yaremonia abana benyu ba butsana na mu lwire lwa <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">Sabato</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Balawi 12:3; Ndangiro 17:10-13.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Muli mungamonia abana ba butsana mu lwire lwa <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">Sabato</char> kwebula mbu aMuomba wa Musa atachibwaamo, kuki amunitsibukira namelamya mundu mu lwire lwa <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">Sabato</char>? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Muterechira amundu yo lubancha nga komuxungaho, wetuwe munerecha lubancha lutunganene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Balawi 19:15; Isaya 11:4.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ye Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Niyo becha i Yerusalemu bauma baneena mbu: «Mbeni amundu uyu ate yobaxonda iita? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Wetuwe, lola kwaneena kyenene, batabamubwira kiro na kinwa! Kuti na bakulukulu nabo, bamemenya mwa kuli kwiye ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char>. <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Wetuwe twichi ha mundu uyu atenga. Hatali mundu yakendemenya alwire lo Kirisitu endehikamo.» <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu abere ali yaiyisa mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char> nianalaka mbu: «Mwa kuli munichi? Mwichi honatengaa? Nitahikire mwa maala mani ngyenawene, wetuwe yanilikaa mundu wa kuli. Imwe mutanichi. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Wetuwe ingye nimwichi, kubwishi anitenga yali, naye yanilikaa.» <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Kubwishi bwekyo, niabanaxonda nchira yemutsimba. Wetuwe hataba mundu wemuatako, kubwishi akashangi kewe kabaa ni katatsakaeraho. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Wetuwe bandu bangi mwa mubuanano niabanamwimirira, neneena mbu: «<char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char> endeba ahika, akendebwerekya tushingishiro tulengitse twa mundu uyu?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">aBafarisayo balika balangi betsimba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />
    <char style="w" lemma="aBafarisayo">aBafarisayo</char> niabanaumpfa abinwa ibyo, byabandu babaa abaneena kuluenda Yesu. BoShebakungu na <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">Bafarisayo</char> niabanalika abalangi babo kweya imumina. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu niananeena mbu: «Nikinali kuuma nemwe ku biro bike, nenyuma kwaho, nikafuluka ira mwa yanilikaa. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Mukanixonda, wetuwe mutendenixunga, kubwishi mutangahika honikendeba.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />aBayahuti niabanabutsabutsanya bonabene ku bonabene mbu: «Hayi ha mundu uyu aya, kwebula mbu tutamuxungaa? Akaya ha Bayahuti bali bobashanchwaa mwa <char style="w" lemma="Bukiriki">Bukiriki</char> neiyisa <char style="w" lemma="aBakiriki">aBakiriki</char>? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Akinwa iki kibwire kite kyaneenaa mbu: ‹Mukendenixonda, wetuwe mutendenixunga na honikendeba mutangahikaho.›»<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amechi momaleta abuingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Alwire lwarekinda alinye ya lwire lukulu lwa mitanda, lwabaa lunene. Yesu nianaimana neneena mu mulenge mule mbu: «Amundu akepfa nyota, ahike yoniri, axome. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Nga ko aMaandiko Makomire maneenire mbu: ‹Yaniimirire, xoko sa mechi ma buingo sikaxoxoboka itenga mwiye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Esekieli 47:1; Sakariya 14:8.</char></note>.›» <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Aneenaa atyo kuluenda aMutima Akomire yakendeangirirwa na bobamwimirire. Mo kashangi umo, aMutima Akomire abaa atatsalikwa, kubwishi Yesu abaa atatsaingira mwa ngulu yiwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abandu balikalikana kuluenda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Bandu bauma mwa mubuanano babere baumpfa abinwa ibyo, niabananeena mbu: «Mwa kuli amundu uyu <char style="w" lemma="mutahwa">mutahwa</char> abaa alirene iwicha.» <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Na bandi mbu: «Uyu ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char>.» Na bandi mbu: « <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char> atangakocha itengera i Ngalilaya! <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />aMaandiko Makomire maneenire mbu Kirisitu endehulukira mwa luanda lwa Ndauti, mwa mutsi we Betelehemu, mwa mutsi wo Ndauti aikalaamo.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma 2Samwere 7:12; Mika 5:1; Matayo 2:5.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Niyo hapfumbuka kahinchangano hakati ka bandu kuluenda Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bauma mubobabaa abaxonda imumina, wetuwe hataba mundu wemutsimba.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boshebakungu bakulu batinda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Niyo abalangi bafuluka ha boShebakungu bali kuuma na Bafarisayo. BoShebakungungu bakulu niabanabutsa abalangi mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki mutaletire Yesu?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Abalangi niabanaxubya mbu: «Tutatsatwaumpfa mundu aneena ngakuno amundu uyo!» <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />aBafarisayo niabanabutsabo mbu: «Nemwe mwanametingwa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Mbeni hali mukulukulu muuma, neri Mufarisayo muuma yamemwimirira? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Wetuwe abandu aba bobatechi aMuomba wa Musa bametukangwa.» <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Mufarisayo muuma mbu ye Nikotemu, yayaa ira mwa Yesu lubere, abaa ali aho. Niyo abwirabo mbu: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Mbeni aMuomba wetu atuhere rubu lwechira mundu yo lubancha atatsaumpfibwa, neri tutatsatwamenya abinwa biwe?» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Nawe uli mwicha i Ngalilaya? Soma kushe aMaandiko Makomire, ukaxunga ku i Ngalilaya hatangakocha itenga <char style="w" lemma="mutahwa">mutahwa</char>.» <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Inyuma kwaho kintsi mundu nianafuluka hamwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na mukatsi musingitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yesu ninaya kwa kitwa kye Miseituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Bwakya mwelutumbi, nianafuluka mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char>, abandu boshe niabanamuhikira. Nianaikala, aba netangira iiyisabo. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Niyo abeyisa ba Muomba kuuma na Bafarisayo baleta mwa mbere siwe mo mukatsi muuma yashatsimbwa mu lusingi. Niabanamuhira mwa kati ka bandu boshe, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />nebwira Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa, amukatsi uyu ametsimbwa mu lusingi. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Kwekulikira aMuomba, Musa atuhaa rubu lwewita bakatsi bali ngakunoyu mu mabale. Nawe, aubula ute?» <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Ibo bamubutsaa batyo kwemutea kinwa, kwebula mbu baate kinwa kyemusongera. Wetuwe Yesu nianaindama. Nianatangira iandika kwa lutaka mu mwolota. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Nabo babere bali yobaiminga imubutsa, Yesu nianaindamuka nebwirabo mbu: «Amundu yatatsakola ntsambi mwimwe, abe yomubere yamukabula ibale.» <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Nianaindama kandi nexuba iandika kwa lutaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Babere baumpfa abinwa ibyo, itangira kwa bangumwa, aboshe niabanatengaho muumamuuma. Yesu nianashiba yeweneho kuuma na mukatsi uyo. Amukatsi ni aimene mwa mbere sa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu nianaindamuka, nianabutsa amukatsi uyo mbu: «Abandu abo bali hai boshabakusongera? Hatakiri kiro na muuma wekuchira lubancha?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Amukatsi uyo nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, kiro na muuma.» Kubatyo Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Nani nitanikuchira lubancha. Iendere, wetuwe utahira ukexuba ikola ntsambi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kyo kyaka kya kwa kihuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu nianabwira amubuanano wa bandu kandi mbu: «Ingye niri kyaka kya kwa kihuo. Ula yakanikulikira atendeenda mu mutsimya kiro na hake, wetuwe akendeba na kyaka kya buingo.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Niyo aBafarisayo bamubwira mbu: «Abinwa byouneena bite bya kuli, kubwishi aupfula amwatsi waweho wenawene.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Nakiro mbu anipfula amwatsi wani ngyenawene, amwatsi wani wa kuli, kubwishi nichi honitenga na honiya. Wetuwe imwe mutechi honatengaa neri honiya. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Imwe amucha lubancha kwekulikira amiyanikire ya bandu, wetuwe ingye nitanichira mundu woshewoshe yo lubancha.» <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Wetuwe nakiro mbu ningachire lubancha, alubancha lwani lungabere lwa kuli, kubwishi nitanicha lubancha ngyenawene, wetuwe Tata yanilikaa ali kuuma nani. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Mwa Muomba wenyu muandikirwe kwa kinwa kyamepfulwa na bandu babiri ni kya kuli. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Anipfula amwatsi wani ngyenawene ne Tata yanilikaa naye apfula amwatsi wani. <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Niyo aBafarisayo babutsa Yesu mbu: «Ixo ali hayi?» Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Mutanichi anabe ne Tata mutamwichi. Muli munganimenyire, nge mwichi ne Tata.» <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu aneenaa abinwa ibyo mwa mango abaa aiiyisa mwa hekalu, ha sanduku ya mitulo yabaa iri. Hatabaa mundu yamutsimbaa kubwishi akashangi kewe ni katatsakaeraho.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutangamenya yoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu nianabwirabo kandi mbu: «Ingye aniiendera, nemwe mukanixonda, wetuwe mukapfa kubwishi bwa santsambi senyu. Mutangakocha ihika yoniya.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Abakulukulu ba Bayahuti niabanabutsabutsanya mbu: «Iye abula ku tutangakocha ihika haya. Mbeni axonda iikonola?» <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Imwe muli ba kwa kihuo, wetuwe ingye nitali wa kwa kihuo kino. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ikyo kyokituma nibabwira kwimwe mukapfa kubwishi bwa santsambi senyu. Kureba mutaimirire ‹kwingye niriho›, mwa kuli ni mukapfa kubwishi bwa santsambi senyu.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Niabanamubutsa mbu: «Iwe wende?» Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Ingye niri yonababwiraa ku niri ihuluka mwa ndangiro. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Niwete binwa bingi byebabwira na byebachira lubancha kuluenda imwe. Wetuwe yanilikaa wa kuli, nani anibwira abandu ba kwa kihuo abinwa byonahulikyaa ira mwe.» <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Batamenya kwabaa asimola kuluenda Ishe. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yesu nianabwirabo kandi mbu: «Mukendeba mwamehangika Muala wa Mundu ku musalaba, niyo mwakengula kwingye Niriho. Mukendekengula kandi ku nitanikola kinwa kyoshekyoshe mwa maala mani, Wetuwe anineenaho byo Tata aniiyisaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Ula yanilikaa ali kuuma nani, atanisiyire ngyenawene, kubwishi abiro byoshe ninerekola byatsiyire.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Yesu abere akinali aneena, bandu bangi bamwimirira.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aluliko lwa kuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu nianabwira aBayahuti bobaimiriraa mbu: «Ni mungaba muketsimba kwa meyiso mani, imwe ni muli bemitsa bani ba kuli. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Ni mukamenya akuli, na kuli ni ikabahira mu luliko.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Niabanamuxubitsa mbu: «Itwe tuli ba lubuto lwa Iburahimu. Tutatsatwaba bapfubulwa ba mundu woshewoshe. Ungakocha uteno itubwira ku tukaba mu luliko?» <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Anibabwira mwa kuli, kintsi mundu yakola antsambi uyo ni mupfubulwa wa ntsambi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Amupfubulwa ataxungwa abiro byoshe nga mwicha mwa kipfunga, wetuwe amwana anaxungwa abiro byoshe nga mwicha mwa kipfunga. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Muala ni angaba akebahira mu luliko, ni mukaba mu luliko lwa kuli. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nichi ku muli ba lubuto lwa Iburahimu. Wetuwe imwe amuxonda iniita, kubwishi amutinda iikiritsa ameyiso mani. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Ingye anineena byo nalolaako ira mwa Tata, wetuwe imwe amukola byo mwaumpfaa itenga ira mwa ixo.» <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Niabanamuxubitsa mbu: «Iburahimu yo Tata.» Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Muli mungabere bana ba Iburahimu, nge mungakolire abyoshe byo Iburahimu akolaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Wetuwe tsene amuxonda iniita naho namebabwira akuli yonaumpfaa itenga ira mwa Ongo. Iburahimu atakolaatyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Imwe amukola amicho yo ixo anakola.» Niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Itwe tutali bana babutirwe mu lusingi. Tututsa Tata muumaho, naye ye Ongo.» <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Ongo ali angabere ye Ixo, munganitsiyire, kureba nametenga ira mwa Ongo na tsene niri hano. Nitahikaa mu maala mani ngyenawene, wetuwe iye yanilikaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Abinwa byonibabwira mutamuumpfabyo kubwishi bwaki? Ni kubwishi mutamuxonda iumpfa abinwa byani. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Ixo ye Shitani, nemwe amuxonda ikola kyo ixo ashashire. Iye mwiti ihuluka mira. Atatsiyira akuli, kubwishi akuli itaba mwiye. Shitani ananeena bubesi, kubwishi wo mucho uwe, kureba yewene mubesi, na kandi ye ishe wa bubesi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Kubwishi nani anineena kuli, mutamuimirira abinwa byani. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Inde mwimwe yangabereretsa ku namekola ntsambi? Na niri namebabwira kuli, niyo mutamuniimirira kuki? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />aMundu wa Ongo anahulikya abinwa bya Ongo. Imwe mutamuhulikya kubwishi mute bandu ba Ongo.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ye mubere ilengya Iburahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />aBayahuti niabanaxubyitsa Yesu mbu: «Mbeni itwe tutatuneena kuli, tukebula mbu iwe uli Musamariya na ku uli na kixwatsi?» <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Ingye nitali na kixwatsi, wetuwe nipfire Tata yo xoni. Imwe momuninenire. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Ingye nitaniixondera ngulu ngyenawene, wetuwe hali muuma yanixonderayo, naye yemuchi wa lubancha. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku amundu ni angaba aketsimba kwa binwa byani, ni atendepfa kiro na hake.» <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Niyo aBayahuti bamubutsa mbu: «Tsene twamemenya ku uli na kixwatsi! Iburahimu apfire, na <char style="w" lemma="batahwa">batahwa</char> nabo bapfire, nawe ni wabula mbu: ‹Amundu aketsimba kwa binwa byawe, ni atendepfa kiro hake.› <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Iwe we mukulukulu ku tata Iburahimu? Iburahimu apfire, na <char style="w" lemma="batahwa">batahwa</char> nabo bapfire. Tsene iwe auixunga ku wende?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Niri ningaixondera ngulu yani ngyenawene, angulu iyo ni italaitse. Tata, yomunaihalilitsira ku ye Ongo wenyu, yonisingya. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Imwe mutechi Ongo, wetuwe ingye nimwichi. Niri ningabwire ku nitamwichi, nge ningabere mubesi ngakuno imwe. Wetuwe nimwichi, nibere netsimba kwa kinwa kiwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ixo Iburahimu, ashaalukaa kutsibu kwexunga alwire lwa arewicha rani. Abere axunga kwa lwire ulo, nianamoa kutsibu.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Niyo aBayahuti bamubwira mbu: «Iwe utatsawaba na bwixuke bwa myaka makumi atano, tsene ungabula ute ku waxungaa ku Iburahimu?» <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku buxondotsi Iburahimu abutwe, ingye nabaa ni niriho.» <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Kubwishi bwekyo, niabanatola mabale kwemukabulao. Wetuwe Yesu nianaibisha, aba netenga mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char>.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya akihumahumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu abere ali yatsuka mwa nchira umo, nianaxungamo mundu yabutwaa ni kihumahumi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Abemitsa ba Yesu niabanamubutsa mbu: «Mwiyisa, kubwishi bwaki amundu uyu abutwaa ni kihumahumi? Mbeni ni kubwishi bwa ntsambi iwe yewene neri ya babuti bewe?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Amundu uyu atabutwaa ni kihumahumi mbu kubwishi bwa ntsambi iwe, neri ya babuti bewe. Wetuwe abutwaa ni kihumahumi kwebula mbu amikolere ya Ongo ixungwe mwiye. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Tulirene ikola amirimo yola anilikaa bukinatsene, kubwishi akiro akiwicha kyo mundu atangakocha ikolamo. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Mwa mango nikinali kwa kihuo, ngye kyaka kya kihuo.» <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Yesu abere ameotola ineena abinwa ibyo, nianachira hashi, niananyuka mwa mate na lutaka mo kakyondo, nianahakako kwa mesha ma kihumahumi, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />nemubwira mbu: «Enda yaukarabe mwa busu kwa kishima kye Silowamu», Silowamu rebula mbu: <char style="it">Yamelikwa </char> Niyo akihumahumi ikyo kyaya ikaraba mwa busu, niakinafuluka ni akilola! <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Abahuwene bewe na bobabaa bahanga bemuxunga ali ahemeretsa, niabanabula mbu: «Mbeni ate amundu uyu yabaa anaikala hashi ni ahemeretsa?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bauma berebula mbu: «Naki, iye.» Na bandi mbu: «Ihi, mundu yamushushire.» Wetuwe yenawene niananeena mbu: «Ngye iye.» <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Niyo bamubutsa mbu: «Amesha mawe malamibwaa mate?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Amundu yo alukwa mbu ye Yesu anyukaa ka kyondo ahakireko kwa mesha mani, niananibwira mbu yanikarabe mwa busu kwa kishima kye Silowamu. Nani nianinaya ikaraba. Nabere mbwanifuluka ni nihara anilola.» <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Nabo niabanamubutsa kandi mbu: «Amundu uyo ali hai?»<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">aBafarisayo balolota akihumahumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Akihumahumi kyokyalamibwaa niabanatwalakyo kwa Bafarisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Na lwire lo Yesu anyukaamo alutaka mu mate, nelamya amundu uyo lwabaa lwire lwa Sabato. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Kubwishi bwekyo, aBafarisayo nabo niabanabutsa amundu uyo nga alolaa ate. Naye nianaxubya mbu: «Mundu muuma anihakaa ka kyondo kwa mesha. Nayire karaba. Tsene anilola.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Bafarisayo bauma babula mbu: «Amundu yakolaa ikyo atatengire ira mwa Ongo kubwishi atatsimbire kweteeko ra lwire lwa <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">Sabato</char>.» Wetuwe na bandi niabanaxubya mbu: «Mundu wa ntsambi angakochate ikola kalolero kali ngakuno aka?» Niakunapfumbuka buhaka bweababo bikanga bibiri. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />aBafarisayo niabanabutsa akihumahumi kandi mbu: «Nawe aubula ute kuluenda amundu yo yakulamyaa amesha?» Nianaxubya mbu: «Amundu uyo <char style="w" lemma="mutahwa">mutahwa</char>.» <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Wetuwe abakulukulu ba Bayahuti babaa batabaxonda iimira kwabaa kihumahumi na ku tsene ahara alola. Ikyo kituma babirangira ababuti bewe <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />nebutsabo mbu: «Mbeni amundu uyu ye mwana wenyu yomubula mbu abutwaa ni kihumahumi? Tsene kiki kyokituma alola?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Ababuti bewe niabanaxubyitsabo mbu: «Itwe twichi ku uyu mwana wetu na kwabutwaa ni kihumahumi. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Wetuwe tsene tutechi kyokituma alola, na yamulamyaa amesha tutamwichi. Ahara mundu atsene. Mumubutse yenawene, naye akabaxubitsa.» <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Ababuti bewe baneenaa batyo kubwishi ni abaubaha abakulukulu ba Bayahuti. Abakulukulu abo babaa ni bameikiritsanya ku amundu yakabula mbu Yesu ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char>, ni ahentsibwa mwa sinakoki. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ikyo kyokyatumaa ababuti ba mundu uyo baneena mbu: «Ahara mundu atsene, mumubutse!» <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Niyo abakulukulu ba Bayahuti babirangira kandi ngendo ya kabiri amundu yabaa kihumahumi nemubwira mbu: «Ha Ongo yo ngulu! Itwe twichi ku uyo mundu wa ntsambi.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Iye nianaxubya mbu: «Ali angaba mundu wa ntsambi, ingye nitechi. Ninechi kinwa kiumaho kwingye nabaa kihumahumi, na tsene anilola.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Niabanamubutsa kandi mbu: «Iye akukoleraaki? Amesha mawe alamyaao ate?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Naye nianaxubya mbu: «Nameotola ibabwira, wetuwe mutamuxonda iumpfa. Kubwishi bwaki amuxonda mbu nibabwire kandi? Nemwe amuxondeba bemitsa bewe?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Niabanamukamba mbu: «Iwe we mwimitsa uwe! Itwe tuli bemitsa ba Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Twichi ku Ongo aneenaa ne Musa. Wetuwe ha mundu uyu atenga, tutechiho.» <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Naye nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Lola ku kinwa kingana kyeshishatsa, mutechi yatenga naho amelamya amesha mani! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Twichi ku Ongo atahulikya mahemo ma bandu ba ntsambi. Wetuwe anahulikya abandu bobamumpfire xoni, nekola ngakuno kwaxonda. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ihuluka mira, tutatangire twaumpfa hobaneena mbu hali mundu yabutwaa ni kihumahumi yalamibwaa amesha. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ali amundu uyo atatengire ira mwa Ongo, nge atakochitse ikola ikyo.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Iwe uli mundu wa ntsambi kushekushe ihuluka abubutwa bwawe! Auxonda ituiyisa?» Niabanamuhentsa mwa <char style="w" lemma="sinakoki">sinakoki</char>.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yabaa kihumahumi aimirira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu nianaumpfao ku yabaa kihumahumi amehentsibwa mwa sinakoki. Yesu abere akorana naye, nianamubutsa mbu: «Uimirire Muala wa Mundu?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Amundu uyo nianamuxubitsa mbu «Ninakuwetu, unibwire Muala wa Mundu yende nge namwimirira.» <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Iwe wameotola imulolako, na kandi iye yashambala nawe.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Niyo amundu uyo aneena mbu: «Ninakuwetu, niimirire.» Naye nianaimanikira Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu niananeena mbu: «Namewicha kwa kihuo kwecha lubancha, kwebula mbu abihumahumi bilole, na bobatsene bahume.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Bafarisayo bauma bobabaa kuuma naye babere baumpfa abinwa ibyo, niabanamubutsa mbu: «Mbeni aubula mbu itwe tuli bihumahumi?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Muli mungabere bihumahumi, nge mutali na ntsambi. Wetuwe kubwishi amuixunga ku amulola, mukinali mwa ntsambi.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Mushinga wa musumba na sambuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu niananeena mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku amundu yataingire mwa lukyo lwa kihyo kya sambuli, wetuwe yauruka kwa mupfunda neingira kwetsukira handi, uyo ni mwitsi na munyai. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Wetuwe yatsuka mwa lukyo, uyo ni musumba wa sambuli. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Amutsamu anakingulira asambuli alutsi, nato sinahulikya amulenge uwe. Naye anabirangira asambuli siwe, na kintsi mbuli mwetsina rayo, nehulukyato hambua. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ameotola ihulukya asambuli siwe ito hambua, ni yaxondolerato, nato ni samukulikira kubwishi sichi amulenge uwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Asambuli ito sitangakulikira mueni, wetuwe ni samushaa kubwishi sitechi amulenge wa mueni.» <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu abwiraabo amushinga uyo, wetuwe batamenya kyabaa axonda ibwirabo.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ye musumba mubuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Niyo Yesu abwirabo kandi mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira kwingye ngye lukyo lwa sambuli. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Aboshe bobahikaa buxondotsi kwingye, betsi na banyai, wetuwe asambuli sitaumpfiraabo.» <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Ingye ngye lukyo. Kintsi yaingira mwa nyumba ya sambuli kwetsuka mwingye ni akaufukala, ni akaingira nehuluka, naye ni akabonekya kyakalya. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Amwitsi anawichaho iiba, neita nebihya. Wetuwe ingye namewicha kwebula mbu babe na buingo, buingo bwa mukene. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Ingye niri musumba mubuya. Musumba mubuya anahana abuingo buwe kubwishi bwa asambuli siwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Wetuwe yakolera faranga, mwa kuli uyo ate musumba, na sambuli sitali siwe. Anasiya asambuli neshaa mwa mango axunga ko anyambwe yawicha. Anyambwe ni yahenda asambuli neshanchato. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Amundu uyo anairatyo kubwishi akolera faranga. Iye atalaire kwa mbuli. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Ingye niri musumba mubuya. Nichi asambuli sani na sambuli sani sinichi. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Ingye nichi Tata ngakuno ko Tata naye anichi. Nahana abuingo bwani kubwishi bwa sambuli sani. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Nitutsa sindi mbuli sositali sa kihyo kino. Ito nato nilirene iletato. Sikendehulikya amulenge wani, kwikyo hakendeba kihyo kiuma na musumba muuma. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Tata ali anitsiyire ni kubwishi ngyenawene ngyenihana abuingo bwani, wetuwe inyuma nikaba nabo kandi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Hatali mundu yanganinyaa abuingo bwani, wetuwe anihanabo ku ishasha rani. Niri na maala marehanabo na maretolabo kandi. Tata yaniteekatyo. <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />aBayahuti niabanalikalikana kandi kubwishi bwa binwa ibyo. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Bangi mubo babula mbu: «Ali na kixwatsi! Mwa kuli iye musire. Amumuumpfira kuki?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bandi bandu babula mbu: «Ibi bitali binwa bya mundu yali na kixwatsi. Mbeni yali na kixwatsi angalamya mesha ma bihumahumi?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">aBayahuti batinda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Lwire luuma, mwa kianiro kya kibulaka, niakunaba lwire lukulu lwareubuka arechanulwa ra <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char> i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu abaa ni atamba mwa mbuwa ya <char style="w" lemma="hakalu">hekalu</char> mwa kisusu kyokilukwa mbu: «Kisusu kya Salomo». <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />aBayahuti niabanatsungula ku Yesu nemubwira mbu: «Ukatutsungulangya amitwe ihikira mangoki? Uli we <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char>, utibatubwire!» <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Imwe nameotola ibabwira, wetuwe mutamuimirira. Amirimo yonikola mwa maala ma Tata aipfula amwatsi wani. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Wetuwe imwe mutamuimirira kubwishi mutali mbuli sani. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Asambuli sani sinahulikya amulenge wani, nichito nato sinichi, nato sinanikulikira. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Ingye anihato abuingo bwa biro byoshe, nato sitendehera kiro na hake. Hatali na mundu yakendetengyato mwa minwe yani. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tata yanihaa asambuli iti alengyitse aboshe. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Ingye ne Tata tuli mundu muuma.» <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />aBayahuti niabanatola mabale kandi kwemukabulao. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu nianabwirabo kandi mbu: «Namebakolera mirimo mingi mibuya mwa maala ma Tata. Uhe mulimo mwiyo watuma muxonda inikabula mabale?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />aBayahuti niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Tutatuxonda ikukabula mabale kubwishi bwa mirimo mibuya, wetuwe kubwishi aukamba Ongo. Auiyira Ongo, naho ni uli mundu ho!» <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Kiandikirwe mwa <char style="w" lemma="Muomba">Muomba</char> wenyu ku Ongo ameneena mbu: ‹Imwe muli boongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Boongo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 82:6.</char></note>.›» <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Twichi ku aMaandiko Makomire matangakocha ichibwamo. Ongo alukaabo mbu «boongo.» <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />«Kwingye, nalondolwaa ne Ongo nelikwa naye kwa kihuo. Yomuneena muteno kwingye anikamba Ongo kubwishi nabulaa kwingye niri Muala wa Ongo? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Niri nitanikola amirimo ya Tata, kunchi mutaniimiriraa, <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />wetuwe niri anikola amirimo ya Ongo, nakiro mbu mutamuniimirira, muharamunaimirirae amirimo iyo, kwebula mbu mukoche imenya neumpfa ku Tata ali mwingye nani mu iye.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Niabanaereka imina Yesu kandi, wetuwe nianaxunukala mubo. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Niyo Yesu aya kandi kwa lindi ishirya ra Yorotani, ho Yohana arubikaa bandu bangi mira, nianaba neshibayo. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Bandu bangi niabanamuhikira nebula mbu: «Yohana atatangire abwerekya kiro na kalolero kauma, wetuwe abinwa byoshe byaneenaa kuluenda amundu uyu byabaa bya kuli.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Neyo bandu bangi baimirira Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Alupfu lwa Lasaro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:38-42">Luk 10:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:21">Yoh 5:21</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 5:26-29">26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:35-43">Mar 5:35-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:11-16">Luk 7:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Habaa mundu muuma mukoni mbu ye Lasaro, mwicha i Betaniya kuuma na bali babo, Mariya ne Marita. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mariya uyo yahakaa Ninakuwetu alungo nekababya abishando biwe mwa mpfiri siwe, ne Lasaro muala wabo yabaa mukoni. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Bali babo babiri niabanalaira amwatsi ku Yesu mbu: «Ninakuwetu, mwira wawe mutsiyirwa, mukoni.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Mwa mango Yesu aumpfaa amwatsi uyo, niananeena mbu: «Abukoni ubo butali bwemwita, wetuwe bwebwerekya angulu ya Ongo nebula mbu Muala wa Ongo asingyibwe.» <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu abaa atsiyire Lasaro kuuma nabalibabo Marita ne Mariya. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Yesu abere aumpfao ku Lasaro mukoni, nianabanda kandi biro bibiri habaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Niyo abwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Tufuluke i Yuteya.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Abemitsa niabanamubwira mbu: «Mwiyisa, hatatsahatsuka biro bingi ihuluka ha Bayahuti babaa abaxonda ikukabula mabale, tsene auxonda iyayo kandi!» <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Mwa mubitsi muli saa ikumi na ibiri. Amundu ni angaba akeenda mu mwishi atangatsitala, kubwishi niaxunga kwa kyaka kya kwa kihuo kino. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Wetuwe amundu ni angaba akeenda mu kiro, ni akatsitala, kubwishi ni atawete ku kyaka mwiye.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu abere ameneena abinwa ibyo, nianabwirabo kandi mbu: «Mwira wetu Lasaro ameya tulo, wetuwe naya imusisimula.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Abemitsa niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, ali ameya tulo, ni akalama.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesu abaa ni aneena ku Lasaro amepfa, wetuwe abemitsa bewe baanikira mbu aneena kuluenda tulo, twa tulo. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Niyo Yesu abwirabo kyenene mbu: «Lasaro amepfa. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Nani anibamoera, kubwishi nitabaayo, kwebula mbu muimirire. Tuende ira yali.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi, yalukwa mbu: «Ihasha», nianabwira abemitsa balikyabo mbu: «Netwe tuende, tupfe kuuma naye.»<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ye pfuka na buingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Mwa mango Yesu ahikaa, nianashingana Lazaro ni amepanda biro bine mwesinda. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Hakati ka mutsi we Betaniya na mulungu we Yerusalemu, habaa buende bwa bilometere bishatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Bayahuti bangi babaa bamehika mwa Marita ne Mariya kwechirabo mikocho kubwishi bwa lupfu lwa muala wabo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Marita abere aumpfao ku Yesu awicha, nianaya imukokera mwa nchira, wetuwe Mariya nianashiba mwa nyumba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marita nianabwira Yesu mbu: «Ninakuwetu, uli wabaa hano, nge muala wetu atapfire. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Tsene, nichi ku kindu kyoshekyoshe kyoukahema Ongo, akakuhakyo.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Muala wenyu akapfuka.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marita nianaxubya mbu: «Nichi kwakendepfuka mwa mango abandu bendepfuka mwa lwire lwa ntsindiro.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Ingye, ngye ipfuka na buingo, ula yaniimirire, endebaho nakiro apfa. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Na yaliho neniimirira ingye, atendepfa kiro na hake. Mbeni uimirire ikyo?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Nianaxubya mbu: «Naki, Ninakuwetu, niimirire kwiwe we <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char>, Muala wa Ongo, yawicha mwa kihuo.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfukya Lasaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Marita abere ameneena abinwa ibyo, nianaya ibirangira Mariya mwali wabo nemubuherera mbu: «Mwiyisa amewicha, naye akubirangira.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Mwa mango Mariya aumpfaatyo, nianabatuka chuba kweya imushingana. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu abaa ni atatsaingira neki mwa mutsi, abaa ni akinali ho Marita amushinganaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Mwa mango aBayahuti bobabaa mwa nyumba kuuma ne Mariya, kwemuchira mikocho babere baxunga kwamebatuka chuba nehuluka, niabanamukulikira. Baanikira mbu aya ilirira kwe sinda. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mariya abere ahika ho Yesu abaa ali nemuxungako, nianapfukama mwa mbere siwe neneena mbu: «Ninakuwetu, uli wabaa hano, nge muala wetu atapfire.» <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Mwa mango Yesu amuxungaa ali alira, na Bayahuti bobawichaa kuuma naye nabo ni abalira, nianaumpfa bwaale bungi mwa mwete, aba neyongwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Nianabutsabo mbu: «Mwamutaa hai?» Niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, wiche, ulole.» <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu nianalira. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Kubatyo Bayahuti bauma niabananeena mbu: «Lola kwabaa amutsiyire ngaki!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Wetuwe na bandi mubo niabananeena mbu: «Iye yalamyaa akihumahumi, atanganahangire Lasaro mbu atapfaa?» <verse eid="JHN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Niyo Yesu aumpfa kandi bwaale bungi, neya kwa isinda. Aresinda iro rabaa ni lukunda lukingirwe mwi bale linene. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu nianabwira abandu bobabaa aho mbu: «Mutengye arebale iri!» Wetuwe Marita, mwali wabo amundu yapfire, nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, aharabeha tsene, kubwishi byahara biro bine ibi aterwe!» <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Nitasanikubwira ku ukeniimirira ni ukalola kwa ngulu ya Ongo?» <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Niabanatengya arebale iro. Yesu nianalalamira mu mbingu, neneena mbu: «Tata, anikusima kubwishi wameniumpfira. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ninechi ku unaniumpfira abiro byoshe, wetuwe anineena nityo kubwishi bwa abandu aba bobali hano kwebula mbu baimirire kwiwe wounilikire.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Abere ameneena abinwa ibyo, nianabirangira mu mulenge mule, mbu: «Lasaro, huluka hambuwa.» <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Amupfu nianahuluka mwesinda, ni aminirwe asaminwe na milundi mu biremba, na busu buwe ni bufukirwe mu lukimba. Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Mumubohole, mumulike aiendere.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">aBayahuti bakola nama yeita Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Bayahuti bangi mu bobawichaa mwa Mariya, nelola ku byo Yesu akolaa, niabanamwimirira. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Wetuwe na bandi mubo niabanaendera aBafarisayo nebwirabo byo Yesu abaa amekola. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Kubatyo, aBoshebakungu na Bafarisayo niabanakoranya <char style="w" lemma="aBushenge Bukulu">aBushenge Bukulu</char> mbu: «Tuire tute kwexunga kwa mundu uyu abwerekya tulolero tungi? <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Tukemusiulira, abandu boshe ni bakamwimirira. Niyo aBaroma bendewicha ibihya <char style="w" lemma="hakalu">ahekalu</char> na kihuo kyetu.» <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Muuma mubo, aretsina liwe ni ye Kayafa, yabaa Shebakungu kwa mwaka uko, niananeena mbu: «Mutechiki, imwe! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Mutechi ku likwirire mundu muuma akepfa kubwishi bwa abandu, ilengya aluanda loshe kwehwerekerera?» <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kayafa ataneenaa abinwa ibyo mbu abitenga mwa muanikire uwe yewene. Wetuwe aneenabyo kubwishi iye yabaa Shebakungu kwa mwaka uyo. Abaa ni akola butahwa kandi ku Yesu akapfa kubwishi bwa luanda lwa Bayahuti. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Atipfe kubwishi bwa luanda lwa Bayahuti ho. Wetuwe akapfa kubwishi bwa bana ba Ongo bobashanchene mwa kihuo kyoshe, kwebula mbu ahirebo mu buuma. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ihuluka alwire ulo niabanaba na mutima weita Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ikyo kituma Yesu ateretamba kyenene kandi mwa Bayahuti. Nianaya mwa kyango kyo kiri hofi na bweru, mwa mulungu walukwa mbu: «Efuraimu.» Nianaba iyo kuuma na bemitsa bewe. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Alwire lukulu lwa Pasaka ya Bayahuti lwabaa lwahara hofi. Kubatyo bandu bangi niabanauruka i Yerusalemu buxondotsi bwa <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char> kweihotsa. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Abandu niabanaxonderetsa Yesu, naho ni bali mwa <char style="w" lemma="hakalu">hekalu</char>, niabanabutsabutsanya mbu: «Imwe amuxunga mute? Amundu uyu atiwiche mwa lwire lukulu luno?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />aBoshebakungu na Bafarisayo babaa ni bamehana rubu kwa bandu mbu mundu woshewoshe yakamenya ho Yesu ali ni abwirabo nge bamutsimba.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Mariya ahaka Yesu yo lungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Kwabere kwashiba biro ndatu buxondotsi bwa <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char>, Yesu nianaya i Betaniya, kwa wabo Lasaro yo Yesu apfukyaa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Iyo, niabanasheera Yesu yo mbiya yo Marita atekaa. Lasaro abaa muuma mu bobalyaa kwa bilyo kuuma ne Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Niyo Mariya atsimba ngaha ya lungo lwa kichiro kinene, lolukolirwe mu mauwa ma narito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Narito </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muti wanaxoako mauwa mekolamo lungo lwa kichiro kinene.</char></note> ikomire. Nianahakalo kwa bishando bya Yesu nekababyabyo mwa mpfiri siwe. Anyumba yoshe niainahumura kushe. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Wetuwe Yuta Isikariyote yamuhotaa, muuma wa mwa bemitsa bewe niananeena mbu: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Kubwishi bwaki alungo ulu lutashaluutsibwa tinari maana mashatu neabirato kwa bachene?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Yuta ataneenaa abinwa ibyo kubwishi bwepfira abachene bo bwoncho, wetuwe kubwishi abaa mwitsi. Iye yabaa mulangi wa shaho ya safaranga. Abaa anaitolera ku sosabaa sinahirwamo. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Wetuwe Yesu nianaxubyitsa Yuta mbu: «Umulike mu buholo! Amenihaka alungo kubwishi bwa lwire lonendetabwamo. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Mukendereba na bachene abiro byoshe, wetuwe ingye mutendereba kuuma nani abiro byoshe.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anama ya reita Lasaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Mubuanano munene wa Bayahuti niabanaumpfao ku Yesu ali i Betaniya. Kubatyo niabanayayo, kute kubwishi bwa Yesu ho, wetuwe kubwishi bwexunga ku Lasaro yo Yesu apfukyaa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Kubatyo, Boshebakungu baya nama yeita Lasaro naye <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kureba, kubwishi bwaye, Bayahuti bangi batengaa mwa kikanga kyabo, baimirira Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aingira i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Bwabere bwakya, mubuanano munene wa bandu bobahikaa mwa lwire lukulu lwa <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char> baumpfao ku Yesu awicha i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Aboshe niabanatsimba mangarara neenda imukokera, ni abalaka mu mulenge mule mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Hosana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Aashanirwe ula yawicha mwetsina ra Ninakuwetu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Ongo aashanire amwami we Isiraeri.»<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu nianashingana kyana kya punda, nianakambira kukyo, nga kwa Maandiko Makomire mabwire mbu:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«Mutaubahaa mwe becha i Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Talola kwa mwami wenyu awicha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">ni akambire ku kyana kya punda.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Abemitsa bewe batamenya abinwa ibyo kasa, wetuwe Yesu abere amehabwa angulu, niyo baubuka ku abinwa ibyo byaandikwaa kuluenda iye, na batyo kobanamuimiriraa.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Aboshe bobabaa kuuma ne Yesu mwa mango abirangiraa Lasaro kwatenge mwesinda nemupfukya, bapfula amwatsi wa byobalolaako. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Kubwishi bwekyo, bandu bangi niabanaya imukokera, kureba babaa bameumpfao ku amekola akalolero ako. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />aBafarisayo niabanabutsabutsanya mbu: «Mutatsene ku mutangakikochaki? Mutsene kwakihuo kyoshe akimukulikira!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">aBakiriki abaxonda ixunga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Bakiriki bauma babaa mwa bandu bobahikaa i Yerusalemu kweimanikira Ongo mwa lwire lukulu. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Niyo bandu abo baendera Firipo yabaa mwicha i Betesaita ye Ngalilaya. Niabanamubutsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, atuxonda ixunga Yesu.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Firipo nianaya ibwira Andereya, nenyuma kwaho, ababiri boshe niabanaya ipfulirao Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Akashangi ko Muala wa Mundu akahabwamo ngulu kameeraho. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku ambeke ya ngano itabyalirwe mwa lutaka nepfa, itangaerakoki. Wetuwe ni ingaba ikexwikwa mu mutaka nepfa, niyo yaxuka, neerako bipfuma bingi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Ula yatsiyire abuingo buwe endehetsabo. Wetuwe ula yatalaire kubo mwa kihuo muno, uyo ni alangabo ihikira mwa buingo bwa biro byoshe. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Amundu ali axonda inikolera, ni anikulikira, kubatyo amukotsi wani akaba honiri. Amundu akenikolera, Tata ni akamupfa xoni.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfula amwatsi wa lupfu luwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«Tsene, amwete wani ayongirwe, nineeneki? ‹Niheme Tata aniufule mwa kashangi kano› Kubwishi akashangi kano kokatumaa niwicha. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tata, ha retsina rawe ro ngulu!» Amulenge nianaumpfibwa ni atenga mu mbingu mbu: «Nameharo ngulu, nikaharo ngulu kandi.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Abandu bobabaa baimene aho na bobahulikyaa amulengoyo niabanabula mbu: «Uyo shali mulashano!» Na bandi niabananeena mbu: «Uyo shali malaika yameneena naye!» <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Wetuwe Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Amulenge uyo atashaumpfibwa kubwishi bwangye, wetuwe kubwishi bwemwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Tsene kwonoko, akashangi karechira akihuo kyo lubancha, na mwami wa kihuo kino akaumwa ira mbua. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Wetuwe mwa mango nikendekukumwa itenga kwa kihuo kuno, nendekura abandu boshe kwewicha ira mwani. <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesu aneenaa atyo kwebwerekya ngakuno akapfa lupfuki.» <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Abandu niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Itwe twamesoma mwa Muomba ku <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char> alirene ibaho abiro byoshe. Unganeenote ku Muala wa Mundu, alirene ikukumwa? Ne Muala wa Munduyo yende?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Akyaka kiri mwa kati kenyu mu kashangi kake. Mutambe mwa mango mukinawete ku kyaka, kwebula mbu mutaxwikwaa na mutsimya, kubwishi yatamba mu mutsimya atechi haya. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Kwikyo, muimirire akyaka mwa kashangi mukinawete kukyo, kwebula mbu mube bandu ba kyaka.»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">aBayahuti batinda imirira</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu abere ameneena abinwa ibyo, nianaiendera neibisha hale nabo.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Nakiro mbu Yesu akolaa tushingishiro tungi mwa mbere sabo, batamuimirira, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />kwebula mbu abinwa <char style="w" lemma="mutahwa">byamutahwa</char> Isaya aneenaa bibererere mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Ninakuwetu, inde yaimirire amwatsi wotwapfulaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Inde yaxwikulwirwaa amikolere ya maala ma Ninakuwetu?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 53:1.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Babaa batangakocha iimirira, nekulikira abinwa byo Ongo abwiraa Isaya kandi mbu:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Ongo amehumya amesha mabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">kwebula mbu matalolaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Ameira amyete yabo yo mitsibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">kwebula mbu batanibindukiraa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">nani nitangecheufulabo.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 6:10.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya aneenaa abinwa ibi kubwishi axungaa angulu ya Yesu ni iri hale, naye aneenaa kuluenda iye. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Bakulukulu bangi ba Bayahuti bobabaaho niabanaimirira Yesu. Wetuwe kubwishi bwa Bafarisayo, batapfulao ku bameimirira. Baubahaa ku bangahentsibwa mwa <char style="w" lemma="sinakoki.">sinakoki</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Ibo batsiyiraa ihabwa ngulu na bandu, irengya ihabwa ngulu itengire ira mwa Ongo.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alubancha lwaretinda iimirira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu nianalehya amulenge mbu: «Yaniimirire ni ataniimirire ingyeho, wetuwe ni aimirire ula yanilikaa. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Yanixunga ni amexunga ku yanilikaa. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Ingye namehika mwa kihuo ngakuno kyaka, kwebula mbu mundu woshewoshe yakaniimirira atabaa mu mutsimya. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Amundu akehulikya abinwa byani butsira itsimba kubyo, ni ate ngye ngyenikendemuchira lubancha. Kubwishi nitawichaa ichira akihuo kyo lubancha, wetuwe nawichaa kweufulakyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Ula yanitinda na yataikiritse abinwa byani akachirwa lubancha kwekulikirabyo. Akinwa kyonaneenaa kyokikendemuchira lubancha mwa lwire lwa ntsindiro. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Kubwishi nitaneenaa abinwa ibyo mu maala mani ngyenawene. Wetuwe Tata yanilikaa yanikalihyaa abinwa byonilirene ineena neiyisa. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Nani nichi ku areteeko liwe linaleta buingo bwa biro byoshe. Kubwishi bwekyo, ingye anineenaho byo Tata amenibwira mbu nineene.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aoya abishando bya bemitsa bewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Kwabaa ni kwashiba lwire luuma buxondotsi bwa lwire lukulu lwa <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char>. Yesu amenyaa ku akashangi kewe ka retenga kwa kihuo nefuluka ira mwa Ishe kameeraho. Iye abaa atsiyire abandu bewe bobabaa mwa kihuo, nianatsiyirabo ihikira kwa ntsindiro.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe babere bali yabalengera, Shitani abaa niameotola iisiritsa Yuta Isikariyote muala wa Simoni mbu ahote Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu amenyaa ku Ishe amehira abindu boshe mwa minwe siwe, na kwiye yewene atengaa ira mwa Ongo na ku afuluka ira mwa Ongo. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Kubatyo Yesu nianatenga habaa alira abilyo, nianakungula alukimba lwabaa aixwikire, nianaimina kiremba mwa mbindi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Inyuma kwaho nianahira mechi mu kipfuma, netangira ioya abishando bya bemitsa bewe nekababyayo mwa mutete uyo yoshaimina mwa mbindi. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Abere ahika ku Simoni Petero, nianamubwira mbu: «Ninakuwetu, mbeni mwa kuli ukananioya abishando?»<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Tsene, utatsawamenya akinwa kyonikola, wetuwe ukamenyako inyuma.»<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petero nianamubwira mbu: «Utinioye kwa bishando byani kiro na hake!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Nitakuoyitse kwa bishando, ni utawete buuma nani.»<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petero nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, kuli koluli lutyo, utanioyaaho kwa bishando, wetuwe nioye na kwa maboko, na kwa mutwe.»<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Yamekinda owa atalirene ikaraba kandi, biri bite abishando biweho, kubwishi amubiri uwe woshe ni akomire. Nemwe mukomire, wetuwe mute mweboshe.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu abaa echi kushe yakendemuhota, kyokyametuma aneena mbu: «Aboshe batakomire.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Yesu abere ameotola ioyabo abishando, nianaimbala alukimba luwe, nefuluka kwelya biro, nebwirabo mbu: «Mwamemenya akinwa kyonamebakolera? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Amuniluka mbu Mwiyisa neri mbu Ninakuwetu, amuneena kuli. Muyaitse, kubwishi koniri nityo. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Kubwishi bwekyo, ali ingye, ngye Ninakuwenyu, na Mwiyisa wenyu, namebaoya kwa bishando, imwe nemwe mulirene ioyanya kwa bishando. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ingye namebaha imwe mushinga, munerekola nga konamebakolera. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku amukotsi ate ye mukulukulu ilengya ninakuwabo, neri andumwa italengitse yamulikaa. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Tsene komwamemenyabyo, mukaashanirwa kutsibu mukerekola nga kobibwire.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />«Nitanibaahula mweboshe, nichi bonalondolaa. Wetuwe abinwa byobineenwa mwa Maandiko Makomire bilirene ibererera mbu: ‹Yonashangiraa naye amukati, ameba mulenda wani.›»<verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Tsene anibabwira buxondotsi abinwa byoshe ibi lubere bihike, kwebula mbu mwa mango byendehika ni mwaimirira ku Ingye ngye Iye. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku kintsi mundu yakokera yanilikaa ni anikokera ignye. Na kintsi mundu yanikokera ni akokera yanilikaa.<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuta ahota Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mar 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu abere amekinda ineena abinwa ibyo, nianayongwa kutsibu mwa mwete uwe, niananeena mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku muuma mwimwe akanihota.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Abemitsa niabanasinderana, kubwishi batamenyaa ngakuno Yesu aahula inde. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Habaa mwimitsa muuma yo Yesu abaa anatsiyira, niasheemere ku Yesu mwa mango babaa abalya. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni, yanalukwa kandi mbu ye Petero, nianamukohetsa kwebula mbu abutse Yesu ngakuno aahula inde .<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Niyo amwimitsa uyo asheemera ku Yesu nemubutsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, indeno?»<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Nikabobetsa kiche kya mukati. Ula yonikaha akiche ikyo ni yoyo.» Yesu nianabobetsa akiche kya mukati nehakyo Yuta Isikariyote muala wa Simoni. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuta abere ameotola iangirirakyo, Shitani nianamwingiramo. Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Kyoxonda ikola, kolakyo chuba!» <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Hatali kiro na mundu mu bobabaa abalengera kuuma naye, yamenyaa kyokyatumaa Yesu amubwira atyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Bauma baanikira mbu Yesu amemubwira mbu aende yaule bindu byobalaireko mwa linye, neri aende yaasikye abachene, kubwishi Yuta iye yabaa analanga ashaho ya safaranga.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Mwa mango Yuta abere ametsimba akiche kya mukati, mu kashahalimo nianahuluka hambuwa. Abutuku bwabaa ni bwamekura.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iteeko lihya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Mwa mango Yuta ahulukaa, Yesu niananeena mbu: «Tsene Muala wa Mundu amehabwa angulu, ne Ongo amehabwa ngulu mwiye. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Ne Ongo ali amehabwa ngulu mwiye, Ongo naye ni akaha Muala yo ngulu mwiye yenawene butsira ileama. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Mwe bana bani, nikine kuuma nemwe mu kishangi kikeho. Mukanixonda, wetuwe nga konabwiraa aBayahuti, nemwe konikababwira mbu mutangakocha ihika honiya. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Nabaha iteeko lihya, mutsiyirane mwenabene ku mwenabene. Nga konabatsiyiraa imwe, nemwe mutsiyirane. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Muketsiyirana mwenabene ku mwenabene, niyo abandu boshe bendemenya ku muli bemitsa bani.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aneena ku Petero akaiyanaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petero nianabutsa Yesu mbu: «Ninakuwetu, mbeni hayi houya?» Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Utangakocha inikulikira tsene honiya, wetuwe ukanikulikira inyuma.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petero nianamubutsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, tsene, nitangakocha ikukulikira kubwishi bwaki? Ingye niikiritse ihana abuingo bwani kubwishi bwawe!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Mbeni mwa kuli, iwe uikiritse ihana abuingo bwawe kubwishi bwangye?» Mwa kuli, anikubwira mbu: «Buxondotsi axongole ikokobike, ukaba ni wameyiana ingye ngendo ishatu.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ye nchira yareya ira mwa Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Mutairirikanaa, mwimirire Ongo, muniimirire nani. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mwa nyumba ya Tata muli mekalo mangi. Luli lute lutyo, nge nitababwirire ku naenda kwebalingiriranyitsa mekalo. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Nani nikendeba namemala ibalingiriranyitsa mekalo, ni yonawicha ibabinga kwebula mbu honikaba, nemwe mubeho. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Mwichi anchira yoiyire yoniya.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi nianamubwira mbu: «Ninakuwetu, tutechi yo uya. Ni yotungamenya anchira yo tute?»<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ingye, ngye nchira, na kuli na buingo. Hate mundu yangawicha ira mwa Tata atatsukire mwingye. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Muli munganimenyire ingye, nge mungamenyire ne Tata. Ihuluka tsene mwamemumenya, nemuxungako.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Firipo nianamubwira mbu: «Ninakuwetu, utubwerekye Tata, ikyo kitulirene.»<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Firipo, nameba kuuma nemwe akianiro kyoshe, mutanatsamwanimenya neki?» Yamenilolako ingye, ni amelola ku Tata. Younganeena ute mbu: «Utubwerekye Tata?» <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Mbeni utaimirire kwingye niri mu Tata ne Tata ali mwingye? Abinwa byonibabwira bitabitenga mwingye. Tata yali mwingye yakola amirimo yiwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Munaniimirira mwa mango naneena kwingye niri mu Tata ne Tata ali mwingye. Luli lute lutyo, ni mwaimirira kubwishi bwa mirimo yanikola. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku yaniimirire naye endekola amirimo yanikola. Na kandi endekola mirimo ilengyitse yanikola, kubwishi ingye naya ira mwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Kindu kyoshekyoshe kyomukendehema mwetsina rani, nikendekolakyo, kwebula mbu Tata ahabwe angulu itsukira mwingye, ngye Muala. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Muli munganihema kindu kyoshekyoshe mwetsina rani, ni nikakolakyo.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amanihisa ma Mutima Akomire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />«Muli munitsiyire, nge mungatsimbire kwa mateeko mani. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nani ni nikahema Tata mbu abahe undi Muasikya kwebula mbu abe kuuma nemwe abiro byoshe. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Uyo ye Mutima wa kuli. Abandu bobatinda Ongo, batangakocha ikokera aMutima uyo, kubwishi batabaxungao na kandi batechio. Wetuwe imwe mwichi aMutima uyo, kubwishi aikere kuuma nemwe, na kandi endeba mwimwe abiro byoshe.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />«Nitibasiye mwenabene nga mpfutsi, nendexuba iwicha yomuli. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Hanashiba kashangi kake, abandu ba kwa kihuo kino nibatikinixungeko. Wetuwe imwe mukanixungako, kubwishi niriho, nemwe mukabaho. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Mo kianiro umo, momwendemenya kwingye niri mu Tata, nemwe muli mwingye, nani niri mwimwe.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />«Yaikiritse amateeko mani nekola nga komabwire, iye ni yanitsiyire. Na mundu yanitsiyire ingye, Tata naye ni akamutsiyira. Nani ni nikamutsiyira neibwerekya kwiye.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuta, ni ate Yuta Isikariyote, nianamubutsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, ukaibwerekya ute wenawene kwitwe, neri kute kwa bandi bandu ba kwa kihuo kino?»<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Kintsi mundu yonitsiyire, aketsimba kwa binwa byani, ne Tata ni akamutsiyira. Na kandi ingye ne Tata nitukawicha ira mwe neikala mwiye. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Wetuwe mundu woshewoshe yatanitsiyire, uyo atatsimba kwa binwa byani. Na kinwa kyomuhulikya niri anineena, kitakitenga ku ingye, wetuwe akitenga ku Tata yanilikaa.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />«Namebabwira abinwa ibi kureba nikinali kuuma nemwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Wetuwe Amuasikya, ye Mutima Akomire, uyo ye Tata akalika mwetsina rani, akendebaiyisa abinwa byoshe nebaubukya abyoshe byonababwiraa.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />«Nabasiira buholo, nabaha abuholo bwani. Imwe nitanibaha abuholo ubo nga kwa kihuo kinakola. Mutairirikanaa neri mutaubahaa. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mwaumpfaa konababwiraa ku naiendera, wetuwe nikafuluka kandi. Muli munganitsiyire, nge mungatsiyire imenya ku naenda ira mwa Tata, kubwishi Tata ye mukulukulu kwingye. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Namebabwira abinwa ibi tsene, lubere bipfumbuke, kwebula mbu mwa mango byendepfumbuka ni mwaimirira. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Nitikineene nemwe binwa bingi, kubwishi Shitani yaimanire akihuo kino awicha. Wetuwe nakiro lwaba lutyo, iye atawete maala moshemoshe kwingye, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />wetuwe abandu ba kwa kihuo balirene imenya ku nitsiyire Tata, nani anikola nga ko Tata aniteekaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">«Mubatuke tutenge hano.»<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ye musabibu wa kuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />«Ingye, niri musabibu wa kuli, ne Tata ye muhingi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Iye anacha kintsi ndabi yoiri mwingye yoitahetako bipfuma. Wetuwe yoinerehetako bipfuma, anerekomyayo, kwebula mbu iheteko bipfuma bingi kutsibu. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Imwe, mwameotola ikomibwa kubwishi mwametsimba kwa meyiso monabaiyisaa. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Muikale mwingye, nani mwimwe. Andabi itangahetako bipfuma iri itali mwa musabibu. Nemwe kwonoko, mutangakocha ihetako bipfuma mutaikere mwingye.»<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />«Ingye niri musabibu, nemwe muli ndabi. Yaikere mwingye, nani mwiye, anahetako bipfuma bingi, kubwishi butsira ingye, mutangakocha ikolaki. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Amundu ataikere mwingye, ni ali ngakuno ndabi yoirekerwe neuma. Asandabi sosiumire sinakongyibwa nelekerwa mu muchanwa, nato ni sashita. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mukeikala mwingye na binwa byani bikeikala mwimwe, ni mwahema kyomushashire nemwe ni mukahabwakyo. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Mukehetako bipfuma bingi, Tata ni akahabwa ngulu, kubatyo nimukaba bemitsa bani ba kuli. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Nga ko Tata anitsiyire ingye, nani kwonoko konibatsiyire imwe. Muikale mwa ntsiyi yani. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Muketsimba kwa mateeko mani, ni mukaikala mwa ntsiyi yani, ngakuno konatsimbaa kwa mateeko ma Tata neikala mwa ntsiyi yiwe.»<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />«Nababwiraa abinwa ibi kwebula mbu mumoe ngakuno ingye, na lumoo lwenyu lube lungi. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Areteeko ronabaha ni rolino: mutsiyirane mwenabene ku mwenabene nga konabatsiyiraa. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Hatali yawete ku ntsiyi nyingi ilengyitse amundu yatula abuingo buwe kubwishi bwa bera bewe. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Imwe muli bera bani, muli mungakola nga konibateeka. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Nitanibaluka kandi mbu bapfubulwa, kubwishi amupfubulwa atamenya byo ninakuwabo anerekola. Wetuwe anibaluka bera bani, kubwishi namebabwerekya abyoshe byonaumpfaa itenga ira mwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Mute mwemwanilondolaa ingye, wetuwe ingye, ngyenabalondolaa. Ingye namebalika mbu muende shamuheteko bipfuma byobitawete ntsindiro. Kubatyo Tata akabaha abyoshe byomuhema mwe tsina rani. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Areteeko ronibaha ni bula mbu mutsiyirane mwenabene ku mwenabene.»<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abandu ba kwa kihuo babaa Yesu na bemitsa bewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />«Abandu ba kwa kihuo kino bakebabaa imwe, ni mwamenya kwingye, ngye mubere nabawaa nabo. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Muli mwabaa bandu ba kwa kihuo, akihuo nge kyabantsiyiraa, kubwishi nge muli bandu bakyo. Wetuwe nabalondolaa itenga mwa kihuo kino, nemwe mutakiri bandu ba kwa kihuo kiro na hake. Kubwishi bwekyo, abandu ba kwa kihuo bababaire. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Muubuke abinwa byonababwiraa mbu amupfuku atalengitse ninakuwabo. Abandu bali baninubyaa ingye, nemwe ni kobakanabanubya batyo. Na bali batsimbaa kwa meyiso mani, ni kobanakatsimba na kwa meyiso menyu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Wetuwe bakabakolera abyoshebyo kuluenda aretsina rani, kubwishi batechi yanilikaa. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Niri nitawichaa na niri nitaneenaa nabo, nge batachirirwe lubancha lwa ntsambi, wetuwe tsene batangakocha iiyana asantsambi sabo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Yanibaa ingye, ni abaa Tata naye. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Niri nitakolaa mwa kati kabo mo mikolere yoitatsayakolwa na undi mundu woshewoshe, nge batachirirwe lubancha lwa ntsambi. Wetuwe tsene bamelola kwa mikolere, na batyo bakinanibaire ingye kuuma ne Tata. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Bamekola batyo kwebula mbu abinwa byobyaandikwaa mwa Muomba wabo, bibererere mbu: ‹Banibaaa butsira kinwa.›»<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />«Mwa mango aMuasikya endewicha, yonikendebalikako itenga ira mwa Tata, aMutima wa kuli, yatenga ira mwa Tata, iye, endepfula amwatsi wani. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Nemwe mwendepfula amwatsi wani, kubwishi mwameba kuuma nani ihuluka mwa ndangiro.»<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />«Namebabwira abinwa ibi, kwebula mbu mutangechesiya abwimire bwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Bendebahentsa mwa <char style="w" lemma="masinakoki">masinakoki</char>. Na kandi, kwendehika kashangi bobakenderebaita, bendereanikira mbu abakolera Ongo. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Benderekola batyo kubwishi batamenyaa Tata, neri ingye. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Wetuwe namebabwira abinwa ibi kwebula mbu akashangi kakendeba kameeraho, ni mwaubuka ku nakindire ibabwira.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Amulimo wa Mutima Akomire</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Nitababwiraa abinwa ibi lubere kubwishi nabaa nikinali kuuma nemwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Tsene, nafuluka ira mwa yanilikaa, hatali na muuma mwimwe yanibutsa mbu hai houya. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Wetuwe kubwishi namebabwira abinwa ibi, mwameyongwa kutsibu mwa myete yenyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Anibabwira akuli: nikeenda, ni munguruko kwimwe kureba nitaendire, amuasikya ni atiwiche yomuli. Wetuwe nikeenda, ni nikamulika yomuli. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Naye mwa mango endewicha, endebereretsa abandu ba kwa kihuo kino kuluenda asantsambi sabo, na kuluenda abutunganane bwani, na kuluenda alubancha lwa Ongo. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Kuluenda asantsambi ni kubwishi bataniimirire. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Kuluenda abutunganane ni kubwishi anienda ira mwa Tata, nemwe mutikyendenilolako kandi. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Na kuluenda alubancha ni kubwishi amukulukulu wa kwa kihuo kino amekinda ichirwa lubancha.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />«Nikinawete ku binwa bingi byebabwira, wetuwe tsene, mutangakochabyo. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Mwa mango aMutima wa kuli endewicha, endebaendya mwa kuli yoshe. Atendeneena mwa maala mewe yewene, wetuwe endeneenaho byakendehulikya, naye endebapfulira amyatsi ya binwa byobyendewicha. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Iye endeniha ngulu kubwishi abinwa byakenderebabwira bikenderetenga mwingye. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Abyoshe byo Tata aweteko byani. Kubwishi bwekyo, shanibabwira mbu abinwa bya Mutima Akomire enderebabwira, bikenderetenga mwingye.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abuyongwa bwendebinduka lumoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />«Hanashibya kashangi kake imwe mutikinixungeko, na mukashangi kake kandi, mukanixungako.»<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Niyo <char style="w" lemma="abemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe bauma babutsabutsanya mbu: «Axonda ineenaki? Atubwiraa mbu: ‹Hashibya kashangi kake nimutakiri amunixungako›, na ‹mukashangi kake kandi, mukanixungako.› Aneenaa kandi mbu: ‹Naenda ira mwa Tata.› Abinwa byoshe ibi, bibwire bite?» <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Nabo niabanabutsabutsanya kandi mbu: «Arebula mbu: ‹kashangi kake› ni bulaki?» Tutechi kyaraneena.<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu nianakengula kwabaxonda imubutsa. Ni yabwirabo mbu: «Amubutsabutsanya kuluenda abinwa byonaneenaa ku hanashiba kashangi kake ni mutamunilolako, wetuwe inyuma wa kashangi kake mukanilolako kandi. <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira: mukalira neyongwa, wetuwe abandu ba kihuo bemoa. Mukayongwa, wetuwe abuyongwa bwenyu bukabinduka lumoo. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mwa mango amukatsi abuta, anaumpfa bwaale kubwishi akashangi kewe karebuta kameeraho. Wetuwe, amebuta amwana, atakiubuka kandi abwaale, kubwishi bwa lumoo lwa rebutwa ra mwana. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Nemwe kwonoko, amuumpfa bwaale. Wetuwe nebalolako kandi, nemwe mukamoa. Wetuwe hatikyendeba mundu yakendetuma muyongwa kandi.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />«Mwa mango alwire ulo lwendeeraho, mutikyendenibutsa kuluenda kindu kirebe. Mwa kuli anibabwira mbu: Tata akenderebaha abyoshe byomwenderemuhema mwetsina rani. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Ihikira tsene mutatsamwahema kindu mwetsina rani. Munerehema, nemwe mukerehabwa, na lumoo lwenyu lukaba lungi kutsibu.»<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ye muhimi wa kihuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Namebabwira abinwa ibi mu mishinga. Wetuwe kukahika kashangi monitikyiendeneena nemwe mu mishinga, nenderebabwira kyenene kuluenda Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Alwire ulo lwendeba lwaeraho, mwenderehema Tata mwetsina rani. Ingye nitanibula mbu nikendebahemera ira mwa Tata, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />kureba Tata yewene abatsiyire. Abatsiyire atyo kubwishi nemwe munitsiyire neimirira kunatengaa ira mwa Ongo. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Natengaa ira mwa Tata, niwicha kwa kihuo. Tsene natenga kwa kihuo, nefuluka ira mwa Tata.»<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Niyo abemitsa bewe bamubwira mbu: «Tsene auneena kyenene butsira ikolesa mishinga. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Twichi ku wichi abyoshe, utalaire mbu bakubutse kindu. Kyokituma atuimirira ku utengire ira mwa Ongo.»<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Mwameimirira tsene? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Muumpfe, akashangi kawicha, nako kali hofi kutsibu, mweboshe mukashanchana, na mweboshe mukaiyendera, na kintsi muuma mwimwe akaiyendera ku munda uwe, nenisiya ngyewene. Wetuwe nitibe ngyewene, kubwishi Tata ali kuuma nani. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Namebabwira abinwa ibi kwebula mbu mube na buholo mwingye, mushibe na mu buuma nani. Mukanuba kwa kihuo, wetuwe muitsibuhiritse kubwishi ingye namehima akihuo.»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Mahemo ma Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu abere amemala ineena abinwa ibyo, nianalalamira mu mbingu neneena mbu: «Tata, akashangi kameeraho. Bwerekya angulu ya Muala wawe, kwebula mbu Muala wawe naye abwerekye angulu yawe. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kubwishi wamuhaa amaala kwa bandu boshe, kwebula mbu aboshe bowamuhaa, ahebo buingo bwa biro byoshe. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na buingo bwa biro byoshe ubo, ni bula mbu abandu bakumenye, iwe, we Ongo wa kuli, bamenye ne Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char> yowalikaa. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Ingye namebwerekya angulu yawe kwa kihuo, Kubwishi namemala amulimo wowanihaa mbu nikole. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Tsene, Tata, unihe ngulu mwa mbere sawe, angulu yonabaa nayo mwa mbere sawe lubere lwa rebumbwa ra kihuo.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />«Namebwerekya aretsina rawe kwa bandu bowanihaa, bowalondolaa kwa kihuo. Ibo babaa bandu bawe, unihabo ingye, nabo bametsimba kwa kinwa kyawe. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Tsene, bamemenya kwa byoshe byowanihaa bitengire ira uli. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Kubwishi namehabo abinwa byowanihaa, nabo bameangirirabyo. Bamemenya mwa kuli ku nitengire ira mwawe, bameba neimirira kwiwe wowanilikaa.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />«Anihemerabo, nitanihemera abandu ba kwa kihuo, wetuwe bowanihaa, kubwishi ibo bo bandu bawe. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Abyoshe byoniri nabyo byawe, na byoshe byouli nabyo byani, nani namehabwa angulu mubyo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Ingye nitikyendeba kandi kwa kihuo, wetuwe ibo bakinali mukyo, nani aniwicha youli. Kubatyo, Tata woukomire, ulangebo mwa maala ma retsina rawe, aretsina rowanihaa, kwebula mbu babe na buuma ngakuno ingye nawe kotuli muuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Mwa mango nabaa kuuma nabo, nalangaabo mwa maala ma retsina rawe, iro retsina rowanihaa. Namelangabo hate kiro na muuma mubo yaherire, ali ate yalirene ihera, kwebula mbu aMaandiko Makomire mabererere. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Tsene naya youli. Anineena abinwa ibi nikinali kwa kihuo, kwebula mbu alumoo lwani lungi lube mwa myete yabo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Ingye napfuliraabo aKinwa kyawe, na kihuo kyamebaabo kubwishi ibo bate ba kihuo, ngakuno ingye konitali wa kwa kihuo. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nitanikuhema mbu utengyebo mwa kihuo. wetuwe anikuhema uhebo maala mehima amulenda Shitani. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ibo bate bandu ba kwa kihuo, ngakuno ingye konitali wa kihuo. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Uirebo bandu bawe kushekushe, mwa kuli yawe. Akinwa kyawe yo kuli. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Nga kowanilikaa kwa kihuo, nani konamelikabo kwa kihuo. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Nameitula kwiwe kubwishi bwabo, kwebula mbu nabo baitule kwiwe kushekushe.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahemera aboshe bobamwimirire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />«Nitanihemera abaho, wetuwe anihemera kandi na bobakendeiimirira kubwishi bwa meyiso mabo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Anihema kwebula mbu aboshe babe muuma, ngakuno kouli mwingye, nani niri mwiwe. Anikuhema kandi mbu babe mu buuma netwe, kwebula mbu akihuo kiimirire ku wowanilikaa. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nahaabo angulu yowanihaa, kwebula mbu babe mu buuma nga kotuli mu buuma ingye nawe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Anihema mbu nibe mu buuma nabo, nawe ube mu buuma nani. Kwebula mbu abandu ba kihuo kino bamenye kwiwe wowanilikaa, nge watsiyirabo nga kounitsiyire.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />«Tata, anixonda mbu abandu bowanihaa babe kuuma nani honikendeba, nabo baxunge kwa ngulu yani, rebula mbu angulu yowanihaa, kubwishi wanitsiyiraa buxondotsi bwa rebumba akihuo. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Tata woutunganene, nakiro mbu akihuo kitakwichi, ingye nikwichi na bobameniimirira aba, bechi kwiwe wowanilikaa. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Namekubwerekya kubo, nikalengeretsa ikubwerekya kubo kwebula mbu antsiyi youli nayo kwingye ibe mubo, na ngyewene nibe mwa myete yabo.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atsimbwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu abere amemala ineena abinwa ibyo, nianaya kuuma na bemitsa bewe kweshirya ra lwichi lwa Kitoroni. Aboshe niabanaingira mwexwa rorabaa liri iyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuta yahotaa Yesu, amenyaa ha rexwa iro rabaa liri, kubwishi Yesu abaa anakoranayo kuuma na bemitsa bewe ngendo nyingi. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yuta nianatsimba kichiri kya basura kuuma na balangi bobalikwaa na boshebakungu na Bafarisayo. Nianawicha nabo mwexwa nibawete ku matala, na ku tuxuku na ku biruu. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu abaa echi abyoshe byobikamuhikira. Nianaenderabo nebutsabo mbu: «Inde yomuxonda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Niabanamuxubitsa mbu: «Yesu we Nasareti.» Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Ingye uno.» Ne Yuta, yabaa amemuhota, niaimene kuuma nabo aho. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Mwa mango Yesu abwiraabo mbu: «Ingye uno», niabanafuluka bunyumanyuma newa hashi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu nianabutsabo ngendo ya kabiri mbu: «Inde yomuxonda?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Nabo niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Yesu we Nasareti.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Nameotola ibabwira mbu ingye uno. Kubatyo, niri ngye ngyamuxonda, mulike abandi aba bobali kuuma nani, baiendere.» <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Abulaa atyo kwebula mbu abinwa byaneenaa ibi bibererere. Abaa niaotwere ineena mbu: «Nitahetsaa kiro na muuma mu bowanihaa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Yohana 6:39; 17:12; 10:28.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Petero abaa awete ku buhombo, nianatengyabo mwa hara necha arekwitwi ra kwa malyo ma mukotsi wa Shebakungu. Aretsina ra mukotsi uyo, ni ye Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Wetuwe Yesu nianabwira Petero mbu: «Fulukya abuhombo bwawe mwa hara! Mbeni auanikira mbu nitixome alungu lwa minubo lo Tata ameniha?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atwalwa mwa mbere sa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Niyo akichiri kya basura ikyo kuuma na mukulukulu wabo na balangi ba bakulukulu ba Bayahuti niabanatsimba Yesu nemumina. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bamutwala kasa ira mwa Anasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Anasi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abaa ni Shebakungu. Wetuwe ni hali undi mundu yakola mwa kihando kiwe.</char></note>. Anasi abaa shetsala wa Kayafa yabaa Shebakungu mo kianiro umo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Ne Kayafa yahanaa aBayahuti mbu lirirene mundu muuma aitwe kubwishi bwa bandu boshe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Yohana 11:49-50.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero aiyana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petero na undi mwimitsa niabanakulikira Yesu. Shebakungu abaa echi aundi mwimitsa uyo, kubatyo nianaingira kuuma ne Yesu mwa mbuwa ya Shebakungu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Wetuwe Petero nianashiba hambuwa hofi na lukyo. Aundi mwimitsa, yo Shebakungu abaa echi, ninahuluka hambuwa, niananeena na mukatsi yabaa alanga alukyo, neingitsa Petero mwa kati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Amucha uyo yabaa mulangi wa lukyo, nianabwira Petero mbu: «Mbeni nawe ute muuma wa mwa bemitsa ba mundu uyu?» Petero nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ihi! Ingye nite mwimitsa uwe.» <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Abakotsi na balangi bobabaa bamechana muchanwa, kubwishi akianiro ikyo kyabaa kya ndibata, nabo ni bali aho ni abaota kwa muchanwa. Petero naye ninaimana aho, ni aota kuo kuuma nabo.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwa mbere sa Anasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Shebakungu nianabutsa Yesu kuluenda abemitsa bewe na kuluenda meyiso mewe. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Nasimolaa kyenene na bandu boshe, nianiyisa abiro byoshe mwa masinakoki, na mwa hekalu, ha Bayahuti boshe banabuananira. Nitaiyisaa mu bubixo. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Aunibutsa kubwishi bwaki? Butsa bobaumpfaa abinwa byonaneenaa, kubwishi bechi kushe byonaneenaa.»<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yesu abere ameneena abinwa ibyo, muuma wa mwa balangi bobabaa bali hofi naye, nianamubanda kihyu, neneena mbu: «Mbeni batyo koulirene ixubyitsa Shebakungu?»<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Niri nameneena kubi, bwerekya abubi ubo. Wetuwe niri nameneena kushe, ni wamenikubita kubwishi bwaki?»<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Inyuma kwaho, Anasi nianalika Yesu ira mwa Shebakungu Kayafa, ni aminirwe.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero ayiana Yesu kandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Mwa kashangi ako, Simoni Petero abaa akinali aho ni aota kwa muchanwa. Niabanamubutsa mbu: «Mbeni nawe ute muuma wa mwa bemitsa ba mundu uyu?» Petero nianaxubya mbu: «Ihi! Ingye nitali mwimitsa uwe.» <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Muuma wa mwa bakotsi ba Shebakungu, yabaa wa kipfunga kya mundu yo Petero achaa arekwitwi, nianamubwira mbu: «Mbeni nitashanikuxunga kuuma naye mwexwa?»<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Wetuwe Petero nianayianaye kandi. Na mwa kashangi umo, axongole niainakokobika.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwa mbere sa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Mwe lutumbi, abasura niabanatyengya Yesu ira mwa Kayafa, nemutwala mwa nyumba ya Kafurunere. Wetuwe abakulukulu ba Bayahuti bataingira mwa nyumba ya Kafurunere, kwebula mbu batangechehala, nefundwa ilya kwa mbiya ya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Niyo Pilato ashinganabo hambuwa, nebutsabo mbu: «Amusongera amunduyu kubwishi bwaki?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Nabo niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ali atangabere mukotsi wa bibi, nge tutashatumuleta youli.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato nianabwirabo mbu: «Mwenabene mumutsimbe nemuchira lubancha kweimitsanya na Muomba wenyu.» aBayahuti niabanamuxubitsa mbu: «Itwe tutawete rubu lweita mundu.» <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Byabaa batyo kwebula mbu kibererere akinwa kyo Yesu aneenaa kwebwerekya ku luhe lupfu lwalirene ipfa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abayahuti babaa banaya ita abandu babi mwekabulabo mabale. Wetuwe, aBaroma ibo, babaa banaya itabo mu ihangikabo ku musalaba.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Niyo Pilato afuluka mwa nyumba, nianabirangira Yesu nemubutsa mbu: «Mbeni iwe we mwami wa Bayahuti?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Auneena utyo kweimitsanya na mianikire yawe wenawene, neri bandi bandu bobamekupfulira amyatsi yani?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato nianaxubya mbu: «Ingye nite Muyahuti. Abandu ba luanda lwawe na Boshebakungu boshabakuleta yoniri. Wamekolaki?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Abwami bwani bute bwa kwa kihuo kino. Buli bungabere bwa kwa kihuo kino, abakotsi bani nge bamenilwira kwebula mbu nitahirwaa mwa minwe sa Bayahuti. Wetuwe lute lutyo, abwami bwani bute bwa kihuo kino.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Niyo Pilato amubutsa mbu: «Ni bula mbu iwe uli mwami?» Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Wamebulako, kwingye niri mwami. Nani nahikaa kwa kihuo kwebula mbu nipfule amwatsi wa kuli. Aboshe bobali kwa munda wa kuli, abaumpfa abinwa byani.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato nianamubutsa mbu: «Akuli kyokiki?» Pilato abere amemala ineena akinwa iki, nianahuluka kandi hambua nebwira aBayahuti mbu: «Ingye nitanixunga kiro na kinwa kyechira amundu uyu yo lubancha.»<verse eid="JHN 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />«Wetuwe kwekulikira andungo yenyu, ninabaminulira mundu muuma wa muliki mu lwire lukulu lwa Pasaka. Kubatyo, amuxonda mbu nibaminulire amwami wa Bayahuti?»<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Niyo aboshe balaka kutsibu mbu: «Ihi! Ate iye. Atuxonda Baraba!» Baraba uyo abaa munyai.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">aBayahuti abahema mbu Yesu ahangikwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Niyo Pilato akalihyabo mbu batsimbe Yesu nemuhirako mihumbo. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Abasura niabanaluka ngata mu ndabi sa mahwa nemuimbakyayo kwa mutwe. Na kandi niabanamuimbakya lukimba lwa kishia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lukimba lwa kishia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa Bayahuti alukimba lwa kishia lwabaa kantsu ka bami.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Berewicha yarali ni ababula mbu: «Bwakyere Mwami wa Bayahuti!» Niabanamukubita bihyu. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato nianahuluka kweya hambua kandi nebwira aBayahuti mbu: «Muumpfe, nikabaleteraye hambua hano, kwebula mbu mumenye ku nitaxungire ku kiro na kinwa kiuma kyokyangatuma nimuchira lubancha.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Niyo Yesu ahuluka hambua, ni aimbere angata ya mahwa kwa mutwe na lukimba lwa kishia. Ne Pilato nianabwira abandu mbu: «Amundu wenyu uyu!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Boshebakungu na balangi ba hekalu babere bamuxunga, niabanalaka mbu: «Umuhangike ku musalaba! Umuhangike ku musalaba!» Pilato nianabwirabo mbu: «Mumutsimbe mwenabene nemuhangika, kubwishi ingye nitaxungire ku kiro kinwa kyokingatuma nimuchira lubancha.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />aBayahuti niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Kwekulikira aMuomba wetu amundu uyo analirene iitwa, kubwishi ailukaa mbu Muala wa Ongo.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Balawi 24:16.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato abere ameumpfa akinwa ikyo, nianaubaha kutsibu. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Nianaxuba ifuluka mwa nyumba nebutsa Yesu mbu: «Mbeni uli mwicha hai?» Wetuwe Yesu atamuxubyitsa kiro na kinwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilato nianamubutsa mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki utaunixubyitsa? Mbeni iwe utechi ku niri na maala mekuminula, na maala mekuhangika ku musalaba?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Utawete kiro maala moshemoshe kwingye, mali mataliho mouherwe ne Ongo. Kubatyo, amundu yashanihota yo uli, antsambi yiwe nene kutsibu ikulengya.» <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Ihuluka akashangi ako, Pilato nianaxonda nchira yeminula Yesu. Wetuwe aBayahuti niabanalaka mbu: «Ukeminula amundu uyu, ni ute mwira wa mwami Kaisari. Kintsi mundu yanaiyira mwami, ni mulenda wa mwami Kaisari.» <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilato abere ameumpfa abinwa ibyo, nianatwala Yesu hambua. Nianaikala ku kipfumbi ahandu hohanalukwa mwa Kieburaniya mbu: «Kabata», rebula mbu: «Hohabambirwe mu mabale.» <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Lwabaa lwire luxondolere alwire lukulu lwa Pasaka, mu saa asishembashemba saa ndatu sa kati ka mwishi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aBayahuti babaa batutsa ndungo ye iteanya mwa lwire lubere lwa lwire lukulu lwa Pasaka. Itangira saa ndatu sa mwishi sa lwire ulo, mo babaa banaita asambuli sa Pasaka mwa hekalu. </char></note>. Pilato nianabwira aBayahuti mbu: «Uyu yo Mwami wenyu!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Wetuwe niabanalaka mbu: «Umwite! Umuhangike ku musalaba!» Pilato nianabutsabo mbu: «Amuxonda mbu nihangike amwami wenyu ku musalaba?» aBoshebakungu niabanaxubya mbu: «Itwe tutawete undi mwami ali ate mwami Kaisari.» <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Niyo Pilato ahabo Yesu, kwebula mbu ahangikwe ku musalaba.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abasura bahangika Yesu ku musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu nianatenga mwa mulungu ni ahete amusalaba uwe ihikira hohanalukwa mwa Kieburaniya mbu: «Kolikota», rebula mbu: «Handu hakahangatsi.» <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Aho ha basura bahangikaa Yesu kwa musalaba, kuuma na bandi balume babiri. Muuma kwa malyo, na undi kwa malembe ma Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:18">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesu est pendu sur la croix" file="WA03926b.tif" size="col" loc="JHN 19:16" copy="Graham Wade" ref="19:18">Yesu ahangikwa ku musalaba</figure><verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato nianakalihya mbu baandike binwa byobikahirwa hambashiro wa musalaba wa Yesu, byobiandikirwe mbu: «Yesu we Nasareti, Mwami wa Bayahuti.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Bayahuti bangi beresoma areandiko iro kubwishi ho Yesu ahangikwaa habaa hofi na mulungu we Yerusalemu, na reandiko iro rabaa liandikirwe mu Kieburaniya, na mu Kilatini, na mu Kikiriki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Niyo aBoshebakungu ba Bayahuti babwira Pilato mbu: «Utaandikaa mbu mwami wa Bayahuti, wetuwe uandike mbu: ‹Amundu uyu aneenaa mbu ingye, ngye mwami wa Bayahuti.›»<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Byonameandika, byameandikwa!»<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Abasura babere bameotola ihangika Yesu kwa musalaba, niabanatsimba asangimba siwe neabanato mu mihango ine. Niabanaha kintsi musura muhango muuma. Niabanatsimba kandi akantsu kewe kokabaa katawete mulando, kalandirwe mu kiche kiumaho itenga iluulu na hetako. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Abasura niabanabwirana mbu: «Tutaberengaa akantsu aka, wetuwe tukubireko mbayi, kwebula mbu tumenye ngakuno kakaba kande.» Abinwa ibi byabaa kwebula mbu aMaandiko Makomire mabererere, momabwire mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Baabanaa asangimba sani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">Na kantsu kani bakubirako mbayi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 22:18.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">Abinwa ibyo byabasura bakolaa.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Habaa bakatsi bane ni baimene hofi na musalaba wa Yesu. Abakatsi abo bobano: Mariya nina wa Yesu, ne mwali wabo nina wa Yesu, ne Mariya muka Kileopa, ne Mariya we Makitala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Kubatyo mwa mango Yesu axungaa ku nina, na mwimitsa yabaa anamutsiyira, ni aimene hofi naye, nianabwira nina mbu: «Tsene mali, uyu ye muala wawe.»<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Nenyuma kwaho, nianabwira amwimitsa uyo mbu: «Tsene uyu ye nyoko.» Ihuluka akashangi ako, amwimitsa uyo nianatwala Mariya mwamwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alupfu lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Inyuma kwaho, kubwishi Yesu ni echi kwa binwa byoshe byameberera, na kwebereretsa aMaandiko Makomire, nianabula mbu: «Nipfire nyota.» <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Aho habaa hali kipfuma kiuchwire tifai ya ngala. Abasura niabanabobya fufuma mwa tifai iyo, baminayo ku ndabi ya hisopo, nehirayo kwa mitutu yiwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu abere amexona kwa tifai iyo, niananeena mbu: «Abyoshe byamebererera!» Inyuma kwaho, nianaindamya amutwe netowa amutima.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musura muuma apfula Yesu ye singa mwa lubapfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Alwire ulo lwabaa lwelingiliranya alwire lukulu lwa Sabato yoiwicha. Kubwishi bwekyo, aBayahuti batatsiya mbu asandundwe sabobahangikirwe sishibe kwa misalaba, kubwishi alwire ulo lwabwaa lwire lukulu kutsibu. Kubatyo niabanahema Pilato yo rubu mbu amilundi ya bobahangikirwe ipfunangangwe, kwebula mbu bahuhuke chuba, na mibiri yabo itengibwe kwa misalaba. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Kubatyo, abasura bawicha, bapfunanganga amilundi ya mundu mubere nenyuma amilundi ya wa kabiri yahangikwaa kuuma ne Yesu kwa musalaba. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Wetuwe babere bahika ho Yesu ali, bashingana ni amekinda ihuhuka. Kubatyo bataxuba ipfunanganga amilundi yiwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Wetuwe musura muuma nianamupfula singa mwa lubapfu mo kashangi umoho, shiama na mechi ma xoxoboka. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Amundu yaxungaa kwa binwa ibyo yapfula amwatsi wabyo. Na mwatsi wapfula wa kuli. Na kandi echi kwaneena kuli, kwebula mbu nemwe mukoche iimirira. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Abinwa ibi byabaa kwebula mbu aMaandiko Makomire mabererere momabula mbu: «Hate kiro ne pfuha liwe liuma rolikendefunangangwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 12:46; Ndangiro 9:12; Saburi 34:21. </char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Mandi Maandiko Makomire mabwire kandi mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:37">«Bendewicha ilola ku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:37">yobatobolangaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Sakariya 12/10. </char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atabwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Inyuma ya binwa ibyo, Yosefu, mwicha i Arimateya, nianahema Pilato rubu lwetengya andundwe ya Yesu kwa musalaba. Yosefu uyo abaa muuma wa mwa bemitsa ba Yesu, wetuwe mu bubixo, kubwishi abaa aubahire abakulukulu ba Bayahuti. Pilato nianamuha rubu. Kubatyo, Yosefu nianaya itengya andundwe ya Yesu kwa musalaba. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Ne Nikotemu naye yaendera Yesu mwekiro, abaa ali aho. Abaa awete ku bilo abishembashemba makumi ashatu bya lungo, luxubangene na bubani. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Ababiri boshe niabanaheka amubiri wa Yesu, babungira kuo ko ngimba sihakirweko lungo nga kwa ndungo ya Bayahuti yareta ibwire. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Aho, hobahangikiraa Yesu, habaa hali ixwa, na mwexwa umo ni muli isinda lihya, ni litatsaratabwamo mundu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Na kubwishi lwabaa lwire lwareiringiliranya alwire lukulu lwa Sabato ya Bayahuti, na aresinda ni liri hofi, niabanatamo Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Yesu apfuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Mwe lutumbi lwa lwire lubere lwa reinga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lubere lwa reinga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Matayo 28:1.</char></note>, Mariya we Makitala nianaya kwesinda. Abere mbu yahika iyo nianaxunga arebale rorabaa ribambire kwesinda ni litakiriko. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Niyo alibita chuba kwebwira Simoni Petero na undi mwimitsa yo Yesu abaa atsiyire mbu: «Batengitse andundwe ya Ninakuwetu mwesinda tutechi hobamuhirire.»<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Niyo Petero na undi mwimitsa uyo baihuta kweya kwesinda. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Ababiri boshe baihuta kuuma, wetuwe aundi mwimitsa uyo, nianaihuta kutsibu irengya Petero neba mubere kwehika kwesinda. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Iye nianaindama kwelungulira mwa kati, nexunga kwa biremba biterekirwe kwa musike. Wetuwe ataingira. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Petero yabaa amukulikire, nianawicha neingira mwesinda. Nianaxunga kwa biremba biterekirwe kwa musike. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Nianaxunga kandi kwa kiremba kyokyabaa kixwikire amutwe wa Yesu, ni kitali hauma na bindi, wetuwe ni kibungirwe kyenakyene hamusike. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Niyo aundi mwimitsa yawichaa lubere kwesinda, naye nianaingira. Nianailolera, aba neimirira. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Byabaa bityo, kubwishi abemitsa babaa ni batatsabamenya kwa Maandiko Makomire mabwire mbu Yesu alirene ipfuka. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Inyuma ya binwa ibyo, abemitsa babiri abo niabanafuluka kwawabo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aibwerekya ku Mariya we Makitala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Mariya abaa niaimene hambua hofi na resinda, ni alira. Abere ali alira, nianaindama nelungulira mwesinda, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />nianaxunga ku bamalaika babiri baimbere ngimba sa mweru ni baikere ha ndundwe ya Yesu yabaa iterekirwe. Muuma abaa kwa munda wa mutwe na undi kwa munda wa bishando. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Abamalaika abo niabanamubutsa mbu: «Ee mali, mbeni aulira kubwishi bwaki?» Naye nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Kubwishi bametengya andundwe ya Ninakuwetu, nani ndechi hobahirireyo.» <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Abere amekinda ineena abinwa ibyo, nianakebera. Wetuwe atakengula ku Yesu uyo. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu nianamubutsa mbu: «Mali, aulira kubwishi bwaki? Auxonda inde?» Mariya abaa aanikira mbu kuti uyo muhingi wa rexwa, nianamubwira mbu: «Ninakuwetu, uli iwe weshautengya andundwe yiwe, nibwire howamehirayo, nge nabingayo.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Mariya!» Naye nianakebera, niananeena mu kieburaniya mbu: «Rabuni,» rebula mbu «Mwiyisa.» <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Utaniataako, kubwishi nitatsanauruka ira mwa Tata. Wetuwe yaubwire banyakyetu ku nauruka ira mwa Tata, naye Ixo, Ongo wani, na Ongo wenyu.» <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Kubatyo Mariya we Makitala nianaya ipfulirao abemitsa kwamexunga ku Ninakuwetu, na kwamemubwira abinwa ibyo.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfumbuka kwa bemitsa bewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Mwe luoloolo lwa lwire lubere lwa reinga iro, abemitsa niabanabuanana mu nyumba nguma. Niabanakinga asanyutsi kubwishi ni baubahire abakulukulu ba Bayahuti. Mu kashalimo, Yesu nianapfumbuka neimana hakatikati kabo, nianabwirabo mbu: «Mube na buholo!» <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Abere amemala ineena atyo, Yesu nianabwerekyabo asaminwe siwe na lubapfu luwe. Kubatyo abemitsa niabanamowa mwa mango baxungaa ku Ninakuwetu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu nianaxuba ibwirabo mbu: «Mube na buholo! Nga ko Tata anilikaa, nani namebalika imwe.» <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Abere amemala ineena abinwa ibyo, nianabuhirabo muka nebwirabo mbu: «Muangirire aMutima aKomire. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Abandu boshi bomukendeshashira asantsambi, bendeshashirwa, na boshi bomutendeshashira, batendeshashirwa.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Wetuwe Tomasi yalukwa kandi mbu «Ihasha» yabaa muuma wa mwa bemitsa ikumi na babiri, iye atabaa kuuma nabo mwa mango Yesu awichaa. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Abandi bemitsa niabanamubwira mbu: «Twamexunga ku Ninakuwetu.» Wetuwe Tomasi nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Nitatsa na ilolera kwa ngopfu sa misumari mwa minwe siwe nehira amwolota wani mwa ngopfu sa misumari iyo, na kandi nitahirire amyolota yani mwa lubapfu luwe, ni nitiimirire.» <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />kwabere kwametsuka iinga liuma inyuma kwaho, abemitsa ba Yesu niabanakorana kandi mwa nyumba umomoho, ne Tomasi abaa ali kuuma nabo. Na kiro mbu asanyutsi sabaa sikingirwe, Yesu nianapfumbuka kandi, neimana hakatikati kabo, nianabwirabo mbu: «Mube na buholo!» <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Inyuma kwaho nianabwira Tomasi mbu: «Sheetsa amwolota wawe hano ube nelola kwa minwe sani, lambula akuboko kwawe ube nepfula kwa lubapfu lwani. Utakitikatikaa kandi, wetuwe imirira.» <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu na Ongo wani!»<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Ne Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Wameimirira kubwishi wamenixungako? Baashanirwe bobaimirire butsira ilola!»<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akinwa kikulu kya mwa kitabo kino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu abwerekyaa tundi tushingishiro tungi mwa mbere sa bemitsa bewe totutaandikirwe mwa kitabo kino. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Wetuwe byobiandikirwemo, biandikirwe kwebula mbu muimirire ku Yesu ye Kirisitu, Muala wa Ongo, na kwemwimirira mukoche iba na buingo mwe tsina liwe.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aibwerekya kwa bemitsa bewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Inyuma webyo, Yesu nianaibwerekya kandi kwa bemitsa bewe, ni bali kwa musike wa ngetsi ye Tiberiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngetsi ye Tiberiya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yabaa inalukwa kandi mbu ngetsi ye Ngalilaya.</char></note>. Lola kwaibwerekya kubo: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petero, ne Tomasi yanalukwa mbu «Ihasha», ne Tanaere we Kana ye Ngalilaya, na baala ba Sebetayo, kuuma na bandi bemitsa babiri ba Yesu. Aboshe babaa kuuma.<verse eid="JHN 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petero nianabwira balikyabo mbu: «Ingye naya ihyana fi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Nabo niabanamubwira mbu: «Netwe twaenda kuuma nawe.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Niabanabaneenda, baingira mu bwato. Mwe kiro ikyo batabonekya kiro na kati. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Mwe lutumbi, Yesu nianaxungwa kwa musike wa ngetsi, wetuwe abemitsa batakengula kwiye. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesu nianabutsabo mbu: «Mwe bana bani, mbeni mwamebonekya fi?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Nabo niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ihi!»<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Iye nianabwirabo mbu: «Muume akakira kwa munda wa malyo ma bwato, niyo mukabonekya fi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:6">Niabanauma akakira, nabo batakocha ikurako kubwishi kabaa ni kameuchula fi nyingi kutsibu. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Niyo amwimitsa yabaa atsiyirwe ne Yesu abwira Petero mbu: «Ninakuwetu uyo!» Simoni Petero abere anaumpfa mbu Ninakuwetu uyo, nianaimbala alukimba luwe, kubwishi abaa ni ali bwambura, nianayiuma kwa nyancha. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Abandi bemitsa niabanawicha mu bwato, ni abakura akakira kokabaa kauchirwe fi, kubwishi ni batakiri hale na musike wa ngetsi. Kwabaa kwanameshiba metere amashembashemba iyanaho. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Babere bahika kwa kyambu niabanaxungako muchanwa aliko fi, baxunga na mukati.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Muniletere kwa fi somwamehyana.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Petero nianauruka mwa bwato, nekurira akakira kwa musike wa ngetsi. Akakira ako, kabaa kauchwiremo fi nenenene iyana na makumyatano neshatu. Nakiro mbu sabaa siluire sityo, akakira kataberekaa. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Muhike mulye.» Hataba kiro na muuma mwa bemitsa yaerekaa imubutsa mbu «Ngakuno yende», kureba ni bechi ku Ninakuwetu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Niyo Yesu aipfunda hofi nabo, nianatola amukati neabirawobo, na fi kwonoko.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Iyo yoyabaa ngendo ya kashatu yareibwerekya ra Yesu kwa bemitsa bewe inyuma ya repfuka liwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abwira Petero mbu amukolere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Babere bameotola ilya, Yesu nianabutsa Simoni Petero mbu: «Simoni muala wa Yohana, Unitsiyire ingye ilengya aba?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Matayo 26:33.</char></note> Naye nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Naki Ninakuwetu, wichi ku nikutsiyire.» Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Langa abyana-buli byani.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesu nianamubutsa kandi ngendo ya kabiri mbu: «Simoni muala wa Yohana, unitsiyire?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Naye nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Naki, Ninakuwetu, wichi ku nikutsiyire!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu nianamubwira kandi mbu: «Langa sambuli sani.»<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianamubutsa ngendo ya kashatu mbu: «Simoni muala wa Yohana, unitsiyire?» Niyo Petero ayongwa, kubwishi Yesu amubutsaa kashatu mbu mbeni unitsiyire. Kubwishi bwekyo nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, wichi abyoshe, wichi ku nikutsiyire!» Yesu nianamubwira kandi mbu: «Langa asambuli sani. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Anikubwira binwa bya kuli mbu: Wabere ukinali mutabana, wabaa unaiyimbakya wenawene, neya houshashire. Wetuwe mwa mango wendeba mungumwa, wendelambula amaboko mawe na undi mundu endekuimbakya nekutwala houtashashire.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu aneenaa abinwa ibi, kwebwerekya nga luhe lupfu lo Petero endepfa neha Ongo yo ngulu. Yesu abere ameotola ineena abinwa ibyo, nianabwira Petero mbu: «Unikulikire!»<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mwimitsa yabaa atsiyire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petero nianakebera nexunga amwimitsa yo Yesu abaa anatsiyira. Amwimitsa uyo, yabaa asheemere kwa kipfuba kya Yesu mwa mango babaa abalya bilyo kuuma, nianabutsa Yesu mbu: «Ninakuwetu, inde yakakuhota?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Mwa kashangi Petero amuxungaako, nianabutsa Yesu mbu: «Ninakuwetu, na mundu uyu, kihe kyakaxungako?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Niri nishashire mbu abeho ihikira honikendefulukira, akinwa ikyo kitakutsene. Iwe, unanikulikirae!» <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Amwatsi uyu nianashanchana mu bobaimirire Yesu ku amwimitsa uyo, iye atendepfa. Yesu ataneenaa ku amwimitsa uyo atendepfa. Wetuwe abulaa mbu: «Niri nishahashire mbu uyu abeho ihikira mwa mango nikendewicha, akinwa iki kitakutsene.»<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Amwimitsa uyuyoho, yapfulaa amwatsi wa binwa ibi neandikabyo. Netwe tunechi kwa mwatsi wapfulaa wa kuli.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abinwa bitsindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Hali bindi binwa bingi byo Yesu akolaa. Abyoshe biri byaandikwaa kinwa ku kindi, anianikira ku na kihuo kyoshe kyabaa kitangawata buali bwebikamo abitabo byobyabaa bingaandikirwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>